const GUIDE={"bloodmagic:divinationsigil":{"b":"Sanguine Scientiem","e":"Divination Sigil","t":"The Divination Sigil is probably the first of many sigils that you would like to craft in Blood Magic. In order to craft the sigil, you need to create an Alchemy Array and use Redstone Dust and a Blank Slate as the base and catalyst items, respectively. Peer into the soul.","i":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"minecraft:elytra":{"b":"Sanguine Scientiem","e":"Elytra","t":"Adds an Elytra to your Living Armor. Rather than being trained, the Upgrade Tome must be crafted. This Elytra does drain durability from the Chestplate, but at half the speed of a normal Elytra."},"bloodmagic:livingleggings":{"b":"Sanguine Scientiem","e":"Living Equipment Basics","t":"To create Living Equipment, you will first need Iron Armor (or Iron Armour, if you prefer), some Arcane Ash, and some Binding Reagent. You'll also need at least a Common Tartaric Gem in order to hold the Demon Will required. It clings to me tightly..."},"bloodmagic:livinghelmet":{"b":"Codex Animus","e":"Living Armor & Ars Nouveau","t":"Living Armor adapts to your magical practices. When practicing Ars Nouveau's glyph-based magic, your armor learns and evolves, unlocking the Source Attunement upgrade path designed specifically for source-wielding mages."},"bloodmagic:livingplate":{"b":"Sanguine Scientiem","e":"Living Equipment Basics","t":"To create Living Equipment, you will first need Iron Armor (or Iron Armour, if you prefer), some Arcane Ash, and some Binding Reagent. You'll also need at least a Common Tartaric Gem in order to hold the Demon Will required. It clings to me tightly..."},"bloodmagic:livingboots":{"b":"Sanguine Scientiem","e":"Living Equipment Basics","t":"To create Living Equipment, you will first need Iron Armor (or Iron Armour, if you prefer), some Arcane Ash, and some Binding Reagent. You'll also need at least a Common Tartaric Gem in order to hold the Demon Will required. It clings to me tightly..."},"bloodmagic:upgradetrainer":{"b":"Sanguine Scientiem","e":"Training Bracelet","t":"This new equipment is an incredible help, but its undirected growth can sometimes be... frustrating. To this end, you have devised a form of Training Bracelet to assist you in your endeavours.","i":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"bloodmagic:growthsigil":{"b":"Sanguine Scientiem","e":"Sigil of the Green Grove","t":"The Sigil of the Green Grove is an item that has multiple uses. Crafted in an array with a Growth Reagent and a Reinforced Slate, the sigil can use your Soul Network's LP to nourish and grow nearby plants. The Sigil of the Green Grove's array, plus its primary uses.","i":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"bloodmagic:icesigil":{"b":"Sanguine Scientiem","e":"Sigil of the Frozen Lake","t":"you've heard tell of ancient boots enchanted with Frost-walking, freezing the ground and water beneath the wearer's feet. That sounds like fine inspiration for a sigil! It's even able to be toggled, so you're not in danger of freezing over your farmlands every time you get close."},"bloodmagic:sigilofmagnetism":{"b":"Sanguine Scientiem","e":"Sigil of Magnetism","t":"Increases the player's item pickup range to 7 blocks when active. Toggle on/off by holding the Sigil in your hand, and then holding [] and pressing []. Consumes 50 LP every 5 seconds while active."},"bloodmagic:miningsigil":{"b":"Sanguine Scientiem","e":"Sigil of the Fast Miner","t":"The Sigil of the Fast Miner is a Sigil that, when activated using [] and [], will consume 100 LP every 5 seconds and apply the Haste potion effect. Thus, it increases your mining, digging, and cutting speeds. Crafted using the Mining Reagent and Reinforced Slate in an alchemy array.","i":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"bloodmagic:seersigil":{"b":"Sanguine Scientiem","e":"Seer's Sigil","t":"The Seer's Sigil is a more advanced form of the Divination Sigil. Alongside showing the amount of LP in the bound player's Soul Network, it also shows more information when looking at a Blood Altar. Like the Divination Sigil, it can also be used to edit your GUI.","i":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"bloodmagic:sigilofsuppression":{"b":"Sanguine Scientiem","e":"Sigil of Suppression","t":"The Sigil of Suppression, when activated via pressing [], will temporarily obliviate all fluids in a roughly 6-block radius of its holder. A short while after moving away from the liquid in question, it will return as though it never left."},"bloodmagic:soulsword":{"b":"Sanguine Scientiem","e":"Sentient Sword","t":"The Sentient Sword is a much more effective tool for collecting Demon Will than Soul Snares could ever hope to be. It may seem weak at first, but it is powered by the Wills you carry, so crafting a Tartaric Gem is a must."},"bloodmagic:soulgemgreater":{"b":"Sanguine Scientiem","e":"Tartaric Gems","t":"Demon Will is a very useful resource, but the fragments you have been getting so far are decidedly lacking in power. What you need is a storage item; A Tartaric Gem seems just the thing. What's more, it can absorb any leftover Demon Will you might have lying around."},"bloodmagic:experiencebook":{"b":"Sanguine Scientiem","e":"Tome of Peritia","t":"The Tome of Peritia allows you to safely store your experience. pressing [] and [] with the Tome in hand stores one level of XP. Pressing [] retrieves a level."},"enigmaticlegacy:desolation_ring":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"Burden of Desolation","t":"You can scarce comprehend presence imposed upon reality by Heart of the Abyss, but, as you have recently discovered, comprehension is not necessary for the ability to make use of it."},"enigmaticlegacy:enchanter_pearl":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"Enchanter's Pearl","t":"Among many ways you can harness the power of Wither's soul, there is this truly precious pearl, capable of breaking the limits you usually have to cope with when working with Enchanting Table.<br2/>First, it allows you to once and for all forget about having to run to the table twice anytime yo…"},"enigmaticlegacy:golden_ring":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"Exquisite Ring","t":"A bit more work and about as much of precious gold, and you can reforge mundane iron ring into much shinier and fancier form.<br2/>The only notable property of this accessory, apart from being all shiny and golden, is that it has effect on Piglins similar to wearing gold armor - they will respe…"},"enigmaticlegacy:insignia":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"Charming Insignia","t":"Although this little trinket will not afford you increased strength, speed or will - there is more to it than appears at first glance. It allows you to conceal your name in the eyes of other demigods, and replace it with the one of your liking."},"enigmaticlegacy:iron_ring":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"Iron Ring","t":"Quite simple in its design, this thing could've been forged even by the most casual blacksmith, not to mention a demigod alike you.<br2/>This ring is only useful as all it takes to create is some mundane iron."},"enigmaticlegacy:magnet_ring":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"Magnetic Ring","t":"Despite simplicity of its design, Magnetic Ring already holds some arcane power.<br2/>Perhaps not the one that defies creation itself, yet still quite useful - whatever thing might be lying on the ground around you, this ring will bring it towards you, sparing you the labor of walking to it and…"},"enigmaticlegacy:monster_charm":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"Mark of the Slayer","t":"Sometimes those monsters mindlessly wandering in the dark can become great annoyance. Now that you hold power to forge Netherite, more often than not they're reduced from once considerable threat to a slight inconvenience staining your blade."},"enigmaticlegacy:super_magnet_ring":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"Dislocation Ring","t":"A long anticipated upgrade of Magnetic Ring, the Ring of Dislocation is better in every way.<br2/>Infused with fraction of mystical energy of The End, it covers area twice as large as its predecessor, and instead of drawing dropped items towards you, it... draws you towards items."},"enigmaticlegacy:angel_blessing":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"Angel's Blessing","t":"This spellstone can be found within ruins of ancient temples, those that served purpose you know not."},"enigmaticlegacy:ascension_amulet":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"Amulet of Ascension","t":"By now, you are aware that Enigmatic Amulet in your possession is not unique, and in fact such a thing is granted to many other demigods beyond your time and space. There seems to exist a few variations of it, with different colors and different powers."},"enigmaticlegacy:blazing_core":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"Blazing Core","t":"Among the blazing wastes and seething oceans of lava stretching over blasted reaches of the Nether, among the cries of souls torn apart and forgotten, and ashes that any attempt to lay claim and rule over these wastes were reduced to, there's no surprise to come across the spellstone that embod…"},"enigmaticlegacy:enigmatic_amulet":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"Enigmatic Amulet","t":"When you first stepped into this world, you discovered this thing conveniently lying in your pockets, with no clues to where it came from, nor why it ended up in your possession.<br2/>The vivid stone encased in its core kept shifting, irradiated from within, as if alive - one truly charming sig…"},"enigmaticlegacy:enigmatic_item":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"Heart of Creation","t":"Powers of this stone are so vast and overwhelming, that they appear to have never been intended to be possessed by a demigod.<br2/>It grants you ultimate protection from most environmental threats."},"enigmaticlegacy:eye_of_nebula":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"Eye of Nebula","t":"Found among strange, enigmatic lands of The End, this spellstone is overfilled with enderic energies, associated with traits of dimension itself.<br2/>When bearing it, you will possess abilities similar to that of the enderman, being able to teleport to your victims from seemingly nowhere in an…"},"enigmaticlegacy:astral_breaker":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"Astral Breaker","t":"Classical etherium tools are quite potent and useful on their own, but they are not the limit of what can be forged with all power of this metal.<br2/>With enchanting power of Astral Dust, as well as some more arcane ingredients involved, you discovered a way some of them can be fused together…"},"enigmaticlegacy:eldritch_pan":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"The Voracious Pan","t":"The very bones of the universe, both celestial and eldritch, lay at your fingertips. And yet, you still crave more...<br2/>Fortunately, the unthinkable nature of Heart of the Abyss can be employed in this pursuit of yours."},"enigmaticlegacy:ender_slayer":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"The Ender Slayer","t":"One of the toughest lessons you have learned ever since first equipping Ring of the Seven Curses is that Endermen are no longer able to tolerate your existence."},"enigmaticlegacy:etherium_axe":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"Etherium Axe","t":"Unlike normal axes, this massive beast is designed to serve as tool and weapon at the same time, excelling as both.<br2/>When using it as tool, it can chop down wood in massive space of 3x3x3 blocks, centered around the point of impact."},"goety_revelation:broken_halo":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Broken Halo","t":"When the apostles are perishing, there will always be a strange energy fluctuation spreading out. This makes you, a dark sorcerer, usually curious. You usually wonder if you can capture that strange fluctuation."},"goety_revelation:eternal_watch":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Eternal Watch","t":"After obtaining the eternal item, you managed to conduct some tests on it and understood its essence. After several attempts, you finally understood how to fully exert its function."},"goety_revelation:gold_feather":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Gold Feather","t":"We become extremely vulnerable when casting spells, as they cannot move freely. Unless you have a mount, you must endure the agonizingly slow crawl during the casting time. Fortunately, you've learned a technique from the villagers that allows limited movement during spellcasting!"},"goety_revelation:spectre_boots":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Spectre Set","t":"Sometimes you wonder—how do those blue specters truly manifest? After countless experiments, you fused ectoplasm with echoes of the damned, forging Specter Armor. The Specter helmet remains unaffected by blindness, while the boots grant absolute silence to your movements."},"goety_revelation:spectre_chestplate":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Spectre Set","t":"Sometimes you wonder—how do those blue specters truly manifest? After countless experiments, you fused ectoplasm with echoes of the damned, forging Specter Armor. The Specter helmet remains unaffected by blindness, while the boots grant absolute silence to your movements."},"goety_revelation:spectre_leggings":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Spectre Set","t":"Sometimes you wonder—how do those blue specters truly manifest? After countless experiments, you fused ectoplasm with echoes of the damned, forging Specter Armor. The Specter helmet remains unaffected by blindness, while the boots grant absolute silence to your movements."},"goety_revelation:spectre_helmet":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Spectre Set","t":"Sometimes you wonder—how do those blue specters truly manifest? After countless experiments, you fused ectoplasm with echoes of the damned, forging Specter Armor. The Specter helmet remains unaffected by blindness, while the boots grant absolute silence to your movements."},"goety_revelation:spider_boots":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Spider Set","t":"Spiders are terrifying creatures, yet we can learn much from them.That's why you crafted specialized armor—one that makes you more... spider-like?! The Spider boots protect you from fall damage, while the helmet grants night vision, revealing all even in utter darkness."},"goety_revelation:spider_helmet":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Spider Set","t":"Spiders are terrifying creatures, yet we can learn much from them.That's why you crafted specialized armor—one that makes you more... spider-like?! The Spider boots protect you from fall damage, while the helmet grants night vision, revealing all even in utter darkness."},"goety_revelation:spider_chestplate":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Spider Set","t":"Spiders are terrifying creatures, yet we can learn much from them.That's why you crafted specialized armor—one that makes you more... spider-like?! The Spider boots protect you from fall damage, while the helmet grants night vision, revealing all even in utter darkness."},"goety_revelation:spider_leggings":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Spider Set","t":"Spiders are terrifying creatures, yet we can learn much from them.That's why you crafted specialized armor—one that makes you more... spider-like?! The Spider boots protect you from fall damage, while the helmet grants night vision, revealing all even in utter darkness."},"naturesaura:aura_cache":{"b":"Book of Natural Aura","e":"Aura Cache","t":"Having a Natural Altar around that stores is all well and good, but it would be more convenient to be able to carry it around. In that case, the Aura Cache will prove useful: It stores a substantial amount of in it so one can use it on the go."},"naturesaura:death_ring":{"b":"Book of Natural Aura","e":"Ring of Last Chance","t":"When one is stuck, as one says, between a rock and a hard place, not much can be done - sometimes, death just has to be accepted as an occurence."},"naturesaura:depth_pants":{"b":"Book of Natural Aura","e":"Soulstrider's Armor","t":"When wearing Soulstrider's armor, a magical botanist can feel dark energy surging in them."},"naturesaura:depth_helmet":{"b":"Book of Natural Aura","e":"Soulstrider's Armor","t":"When wearing Soulstrider's armor, a magical botanist can feel dark energy surging in them."},"naturesaura:eye":{"b":"Book of Natural Aura","e":"Environmental Eye","t":"When working with , by nature, it will be hard to grasp just how much there is in any given area or storage device."},"naturesaura:eye_improved":{"b":"Book of Natural Aura","e":"Environmental Ocular","t":"The Environmental Eye is very useful in theory; however, a lot of magical botanists struggle with its limited range of gauging in the environment around them. A simple solution to this problem is the Environmental Ocular."},"naturesaura:shockwave_creator":{"b":"Book of Natural Aura","e":"Amulet of Wrath","t":"The Amulet of Wrath, when held anywhere in the inventory, allows its wearer to focus their power, giving them the ability to, when sneaking and jumping in place, stomp down on the ground hard enough to create a shockwave that hurts any other living creatures close by."},"naturesaura:sky_helmet":{"b":"Book of Natural Aura","e":"Skyseeker's Armor","t":"Botanists may feel like the Gods when wearing Skyseeker's armor. Not only can it be repaired like its infused counterpart, it also provides a set bonus: When wearing every piece of the armor (or swapping the chestplate for an Elytra), the wearer's movement speed will be increased."},"naturesaura:sky_pants":{"b":"Book of Natural Aura","e":"Skyseeker's Armor","t":"Botanists may feel like the Gods when wearing Skyseeker's armor. Not only can it be repaired like its infused counterpart, it also provides a set bonus: When wearing every piece of the armor (or swapping the chestplate for an Elytra), the wearer's movement speed will be increased."},"justdirethings:blazegold_boots":{"b":"Just Dires Guide","e":"Blazegold Boots","t":"Blazegold Boots provide enhanced foot protection and come with the Lava Repair ability. To fully repair these boots, drop them into a lava source block."},"justdirethings:blazegold_chestplate":{"b":"Just Dires Guide","e":"Blazegold Chestplate","t":"The Blazegold Chestplate not only provides enhanced defense but also features the Lava Repair ability. Drop this chestplate into a lava source block to fully repair it."},"justdirethings:blazegold_helmet":{"b":"Just Dires Guide","e":"Blazegold Helmet","t":"The Blazegold Helmet offers superior protection compared to its Ferricore predecessor, enhanced with the unique Lava Repair ability. Drop this item into a lava source block to fully repair it."},"justdirethings:blazegold_leggings":{"b":"Just Dires Guide","e":"Blazegold Leggings","t":"Blazegold Leggings offer superior mobility and protection. Utilize the Lava Repair ability by dropping these leggings into a lava source block for full repair."},"justdirethings:celestigem_chestplate":{"b":"Just Dires Guide","e":"Celestigem Chestplate","t":"The Celestigem Chestplate uses Forge Energy for its functionality, equipped with a 10,000 FE capacity. It's ideal to use a Pocket Generator for keeping it continuously charged."},"justdirethings:eclipsealloy_leggings":{"b":"Just Dires Guide","e":"Eclipse Alloy Leggings","t":"Crafted for ultimate endurance, these leggings are powered by 500,000 FE of Forge Energy. Use a Pocket Generator to maintain their power levels and functionality."},"justdirethings:ferricore_boots":{"b":"Just Dires Guide","e":"Ferricore Boots","t":"The Ferricore Boots are crafted for adventurers, providing slightly more protection and durability than iron boots. They can be upgraded to offer enhanced abilities like increased jumping."},"justdirethings:ferricore_leggings":{"b":"Just Dires Guide","e":"Ferricore Leggings","t":"Designed for both comfort and protection, Ferricore Leggings provide enhanced durability and the option for further upgrades to increase your movement speed."},"justdirethings:blazegold_sword":{"b":"Just Dires Guide","e":"Blazegold Sword","t":"Enhanced damage over the Ferricore Sword. Features 'Lava Repair' for full repair when dropped into lava."},"justdirethings:bow_celestigem":{"b":"Just Dires Guide","e":"Celestigem Bow","t":"The Celestigem Bow surpasses Blazegold Bow, utilizing Forge Energy instead of durability. It can hold up to 10,000 FE, ideal for long use without wear. This bow features 3 'Potion Canister slots', allowing for customized effects."},"justdirethings:celestigem_sword":{"b":"Just Dires Guide","e":"Celestigem Sword","t":"An upgrade to Blazegold Sword, this sword uses Forge Energy instead of durability. It holds 10,000 FE, best kept charged with a Pocket Generator."},"justdirethings:eclipsealloy_axe":{"b":"Just Dires Guide","e":"Eclipse Alloy Axe","t":"This Eclipse Alloy Axe excels in woodcutting with high efficiency and increased energy storage. It's engineered for enduring the most demanding lumber tasks."},"justdirethings:bow_eclipsealloy":{"b":"Just Dires Guide","e":"Eclipse Alloy Bow","t":"The Eclipse Alloy Bow embodies the ultimate in ranged weaponry, providing vast energy reserves for prolonged use. It features 4 slots for Potion Canisters, enhancing arrows with various effects."},"justdirethings:ferricore_axe":{"b":"Just Dires Guide","e":"Ferricore Axe","t":"The Ferricore Axe is not only efficient at chopping wood but also effective as a weapon. It surpasses the iron axe in both durability and cutting speed and can be further enhanced with upgrades."},"justdirethings:bow_ferricore":{"b":"Just Dires Guide","e":"Ferricore Bow","t":"The Ferricore Bow, crafted from robust Ferricore, enhances standard bow functionalities with increased durability and the ability to be upgraded with various abilities."},"justdirethings:ferricore_sword":{"b":"Just Dires Guide","e":"Ferricore Sword","t":"The Ferricore Sword is a robust melee weapon slightly superior to traditional iron swords. Crafted from Ferricore, it not only provides enhanced damage but also offers the potential for further upgrades with special abilities, enhancing its utility in combat scenarios."},"adamsarsplus:adam_hood":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Void Archmage Helmet","t":"Taking your Ascendant mage armor you've discovered how to augment it with the elemental void souls you've obtained to push your magecraft to a level beyond what should be possible."},"adamsarsplus:cade_hood":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Frost Helmet","t":"Taking your Tier 3 mage armor you've discovered how to augment it with the elemental frost souls you've obtained to push your magecraft to an elite level."},"adamsarsplus:camr_hood":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Lightning Helmet","t":"Taking your Elemental mage armor you've discovered how to augment it with the elemental lightning souls you've obtained to push your magecraft to an ascendant level."},"adamsarsplus:enchanters_stopwatch":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Enchanter's Stopwatch","t":"A charm that repeatedly casts spells on a defined interval. The spell can be set using a scribes table. Holding the charm and using it in the main/offhand can increase/decrease the casting interval."},"adamsarsplus:generals_wheel":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"General's Wheel","t":"A charm that causes summoning sickness to be removed at a faster rate. The rate of reduction is increased by how many of the ten shadows are under the wearers control. At max this charm provides a 50 percent reduction in summoning sickness duration."},"adamsarsplus:matt_hood":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Holy Helmet","t":"Taking your Elemental mage armor you've discovered how to augment it with the elemental ancient souls you've obtained to push your magecraft to an ascendant level."},"adamsarsplus:nick_hood":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Earth Helmet","t":"Taking your Tier 3 mage armor you've discovered how to augment it with the elemental earth souls you've obtained to push your magecraft to an elite level."},"adamsarsplus:ryan_hood":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Flame Helmet","t":"Taking your Tier 3 mage armor you've discovered how to augment it with the elemental flame souls you've obtained to push your magecraft to an elite level."},"animus:blood_infused_spellbook":{"b":"Codex Animus","e":"Blood-Infused Spellbook","t":"The Blood-Infused Spellbook combines the power of Iron's Spells with Blood Magic's sacrificial arts. This unique tome can be progressively enhanced through six tiers of blood infusion, each granting powerful new abilities."},"animus:key_binding":{"b":"Codex Animus","e":"Key of Binding","t":"The Key of Binding is a mystical key bound to a blood mage's Soul Network. Its primary purpose is to share your LP with friends - give a bound key to an ally and they can bind their items to YOUR Soul Network, drawing from your LP reserves."},"animus:spear_diamond":{"b":"Codex Animus","e":"Spears","t":"Roman-style throwable javelins. Hold right-click to charge, then release to throw. When thrown, spears deal AOE damage where they land."},"animus:spear_iron":{"b":"Codex Animus","e":"Spears","t":"Roman-style throwable javelins. Hold right-click to charge, then release to throw. When thrown, spears deal AOE damage where they land."},"animus:spear_bound":{"b":"Codex Animus","e":"Spears","t":"Roman-style throwable javelins. Hold right-click to charge, then release to throw. When thrown, spears deal AOE damage where they land."},"create:goggles":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Ars Creo","t":"Ars Creo enables special contraption behaviors for blocks from Ars Nouveau, including Spell Turrets and Source Jars. Basic Spell Turret - Fires a spell on contraption when interacted. Timer Turret - Fires a spell on its interval."},"ars_elemental:air_robes":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Aethermancer's Set","t":"Note: Since the Armor Rework requires a lot of assets work, the light and heavy elemental armors variants won't be ready for 1.19, so the 'medium' elemental armors can be crafted will all three types. Upgrading will keep enchants and threads, but requires the base armor to be at tier 3."},"ars_elemental:air_boots":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Aethermancer's Set","t":"Note: Since the Armor Rework requires a lot of assets work, the light and heavy elemental armors variants won't be ready for 1.19, so the 'medium' elemental armors can be crafted will all three types. Upgrading will keep enchants and threads, but requires the base armor to be at tier 3."},"ars_elemental:air_leggings":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Aethermancer's Set","t":"Note: Since the Armor Rework requires a lot of assets work, the light and heavy elemental armors variants won't be ready for 1.19, so the 'medium' elemental armors can be crafted will all three types. Upgrading will keep enchants and threads, but requires the base armor to be at tier 3."},"ars_elemental:air_hat":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Aethermancer's Set","t":"Note: Since the Armor Rework requires a lot of assets work, the light and heavy elemental armors variants won't be ready for 1.19, so the 'medium' elemental armors can be crafted will all three types. Upgrading will keep enchants and threads, but requires the base armor to be at tier 3."},"ars_elemental:aqua_boots":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Aquamancer's Set","t":"Note: Since the Armor Rework requires a lot of assets work, the light and heavy elemental armors variants won't be ready for 1.19, so the 'medium' elemental armors can be crafted will all three types. Upgrading will keep enchants and threads, but requires the base armor to be at tier 3."},"ars_elemental:aqua_hat":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Aquamancer's Set","t":"Note: Since the Armor Rework requires a lot of assets work, the light and heavy elemental armors variants won't be ready for 1.19, so the 'medium' elemental armors can be crafted will all three types. Upgrading will keep enchants and threads, but requires the base armor to be at tier 3."},"ars_elemental:aqua_leggings":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Aquamancer's Set","t":"Note: Since the Armor Rework requires a lot of assets work, the light and heavy elemental armors variants won't be ready for 1.19, so the 'medium' elemental armors can be crafted will all three types. Upgrading will keep enchants and threads, but requires the base armor to be at tier 3."},"ars_elemental:aqua_robes":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Aquamancer's Set","t":"Note: Since the Armor Rework requires a lot of assets work, the light and heavy elemental armors variants won't be ready for 1.19, so the 'medium' elemental armors can be crafted will all three types. Upgrading will keep enchants and threads, but requires the base armor to be at tier 3."},"ars_elemental:earth_boots":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Geomancer's Set","t":"Note: Since the Armor Rework requires a lot of assets work, the light and heavy elemental armors variants won't be ready for 1.19, so the 'medium' elemental armors can be crafted will all three types. Upgrading will keep enchants and threads, but requires the base armor to be at tier 3."},"ars_elemental:earth_leggings":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Geomancer's Set","t":"Note: Since the Armor Rework requires a lot of assets work, the light and heavy elemental armors variants won't be ready for 1.19, so the 'medium' elemental armors can be crafted will all three types. Upgrading will keep enchants and threads, but requires the base armor to be at tier 3."},"ars_elemental:earth_robes":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Geomancer's Set","t":"Note: Since the Armor Rework requires a lot of assets work, the light and heavy elemental armors variants won't be ready for 1.19, so the 'medium' elemental armors can be crafted will all three types. Upgrading will keep enchants and threads, but requires the base armor to be at tier 3."},"ars_elemental:earth_hat":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Geomancer's Set","t":"Note: Since the Armor Rework requires a lot of assets work, the light and heavy elemental armors variants won't be ready for 1.19, so the 'medium' elemental armors can be crafted will all three types. Upgrading will keep enchants and threads, but requires the base armor to be at tier 3."},"ars_elemental:fire_robes":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Pyromancer's Set","t":"Note: Since the Armor Rework requires a lot of assets work, the light and heavy elemental armors variants won't be ready for 1.19, so the 'medium' elemental armors can be crafted will all three types. Upgrading will keep enchants and threads, but requires the base armor to be at tier 3."},"ars_elemental:fire_hat":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Pyromancer's Set","t":"Note: Since the Armor Rework requires a lot of assets work, the light and heavy elemental armors variants won't be ready for 1.19, so the 'medium' elemental armors can be crafted will all three types. Upgrading will keep enchants and threads, but requires the base armor to be at tier 3."},"ars_elemental:fire_boots":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Pyromancer's Set","t":"Note: Since the Armor Rework requires a lot of assets work, the light and heavy elemental armors variants won't be ready for 1.19, so the 'medium' elemental armors can be crafted will all three types. Upgrading will keep enchants and threads, but requires the base armor to be at tier 3."},"ars_elemental:fire_leggings":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Pyromancer's Set","t":"Note: Since the Armor Rework requires a lot of assets work, the light and heavy elemental armors variants won't be ready for 1.19, so the 'medium' elemental armors can be crafted will all three types. Upgrading will keep enchants and threads, but requires the base armor to be at tier 3."},"ars_elemental:air_focus":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Focus of Air","t":"This spell focus is attuned to the school of Air. While equipped, the glyphs of this school will be amplified and discounted. The lesser focus, as a drawback, will weaken glyphs of the other elemental schools."},"ars_elemental:earth_bangle":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Earth Bangle","t":"This bangle will boost the damage of your Earth spells. Plants blossom on your arms, inflicting snare to enemies hit and granting the wearer immunity to cactus and berry bushes and knockback resistance."},"ars_elemental:earth_focus":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Focus of Earth","t":"This spell focus is attuned to the school of Earth. While equipped, the glyphs of this school will be amplified and discounted. The lesser focus, as a drawback, will weaken glyphs of the other elemental schools."},"ars_elemental:fire_bangle":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Fire Bangle","t":"This bangle will boost the damage of your Fire spells. Your arms are engulfed in the element, setting on fire enemies hit and granting a passive boost to speed while in hot biomes."},"ars_elemental:fire_focus":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Focus of Fire","t":"This spell focus is attuned to the school of Fire. While equipped, the glyphs of this school will be amplified and discounted. The lesser focus, as a drawback, will weaken glyphs of the other elemental schools."},"ars_elemental:summon_bangle":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Summoner's Bangle","t":"This bangle will boost the damage of your Summoning spells. Your summons follows your arms movement, targeting whatever your hit with increased damage."},"ars_elemental:water_bangle":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Water Bangle","t":"This bangle will boost the damage of your Water spells. Your arms chills the air around, freezing enemies on every hit. It will also grant the wearer a passive boost to speed in water and rain."},"ars_elemental:water_focus":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Focus of Water","t":"This spell focus is attuned to the school of Water. While equipped, the glyphs of this school will be amplified and discounted. The lesser focus, as a drawback, will weaken glyphs of the other elemental schools."},"ars_nouveau:battlemage_robes":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Magical Armor","t":"Magical robes will increase the wearers mana regen and can be upgraded with special abilities using Threads. The Sorceror's set provides the lowest defence, but provides the most powerful set of slots for Threads.","i":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"ars_nouveau:sorcerer_hood":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Magical Armor","t":"Magical robes will increase the wearers mana regen and can be upgraded with special abilities using Threads. The Sorceror's set provides the lowest defence, but provides the most powerful set of slots for Threads.","i":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"ars_nouveau:arcanist_robes":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Magical Armor","t":"Magical robes will increase the wearers mana regen and can be upgraded with special abilities using Threads. The Sorceror's set provides the lowest defence, but provides the most powerful set of slots for Threads.","i":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"ars_nouveau:arcanist_hood":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Magical Armor","t":"Magical robes will increase the wearers mana regen and can be upgraded with special abilities using Threads. The Sorceror's set provides the lowest defence, but provides the most powerful set of slots for Threads.","i":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"ars_nouveau:sorcerer_robes":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Magical Armor","t":"Magical robes will increase the wearers mana regen and can be upgraded with special abilities using Threads. The Sorceror's set provides the lowest defence, but provides the most powerful set of slots for Threads.","i":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"ars_nouveau:sorcerer_boots":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Magical Armor","t":"Magical robes will increase the wearers mana regen and can be upgraded with special abilities using Threads. The Sorceror's set provides the lowest defence, but provides the most powerful set of slots for Threads.","i":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"ars_nouveau:arcanist_leggings":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Magical Armor","t":"Magical robes will increase the wearers mana regen and can be upgraded with special abilities using Threads. The Sorceror's set provides the lowest defence, but provides the most powerful set of slots for Threads.","i":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"ars_nouveau:arcanist_boots":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Magical Armor","t":"Magical robes will increase the wearers mana regen and can be upgraded with special abilities using Threads. The Sorceror's set provides the lowest defence, but provides the most powerful set of slots for Threads.","i":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"ars_nouveau:sorcerer_leggings":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Magical Armor","t":"Magical robes will increase the wearers mana regen and can be upgraded with special abilities using Threads. The Sorceror's set provides the lowest defence, but provides the most powerful set of slots for Threads.","i":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"ars_nouveau:battlemage_leggings":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Magical Armor","t":"Magical robes will increase the wearers mana regen and can be upgraded with special abilities using Threads. The Sorceror's set provides the lowest defence, but provides the most powerful set of slots for Threads.","i":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"ars_nouveau:battlemage_boots":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Magical Armor","t":"Magical robes will increase the wearers mana regen and can be upgraded with special abilities using Threads. The Sorceror's set provides the lowest defence, but provides the most powerful set of slots for Threads.","i":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"ars_nouveau:battlemage_hood":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Magical Armor","t":"Magical robes will increase the wearers mana regen and can be upgraded with special abilities using Threads. The Sorceror's set provides the lowest defence, but provides the most powerful set of slots for Threads.","i":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"ars_nouveau:alchemists_crown":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Alchemist's Crown","t":"Allows the wearer to consume potions and flasks instantly from their inventory."},"ars_nouveau:amulet_of_mana_boost":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Amulet of Mana Boost","t":"Increases max mana by a moderate amount."},"ars_nouveau:amulet_of_mana_regen":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Amulet of Mana Regen","t":"Increases mana regeneration by a moderate amount."},"ars_nouveau:belt_of_levitation":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Belt of Levitation","t":"A belt that allows the user levitate a moderate distance above the ground. Useful for climbing mountains! Simply sneak in the air while falling (or jumping) to rise."},"ars_nouveau:belt_of_unstable_gifts":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Belt of Unstable Gifts","t":"Occasionally grants a random positive potion effect for a short duration. These effects can vary in strength."},"ars_nouveau:jump_ring":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Ring of Jumping","t":"Allows the user to continue jumping in the air. Each jump will expend mana."},"ars_nouveau:ring_of_lesser_discount":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Ring of Lesser Discount","t":"In addition to providing a small bonus to maximum mana and mana regen, Rings of Discount reduce the total cost to cast a spell."},"ars_nouveau:spell_bow":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Enchanter's Bow","t":"A bow that can be inscribed with a spell using the Scribes Table. If the player has enough mana, arrows will become Spell Arrows and will apply the spell on their target. If no arrows are in the inventory, a spell arrow that deals 0 damage will be cast."},"ars_nouveau:spell_crossbow":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Enchanter's Crossbow","t":"A crossbow that can be inscribed with a spell. The mana cost of the spell will be deducted when the bow is loaded if mana is present. Enchanter's Crossbows may use special augment arrows to empower their spells."},"ars_nouveau:summon_focus":{"b":"Worn Notebook","e":"Focus of Summoning","t":"A special casting focus. Grants summons from spells additional duration, strength, speed, and deals damage to enemies that kill them. Additionally, casting spells that target you like Self and Orbit will cast a copy of the spell on your nearby summons."},"enigmaticaddons:adventure_charm":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"Emblem of Adventurer","t":"Creation and destruction are the supreme power of the God, but sometimes it can be difficult to grasp the force well, and a slight mistake can easily lead to unnecessary destruction."},"enigmaticaddons:chaos_elytra":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"The Arrogance of Chaos","t":"Since the Heart of Abyss is in hand, why not set your gaze on the sky?<br2/>Based on the same process as the Majestic Elytra, using more evil and powerful materials can obtain these stronger elytra."},"enigmaticaddons:cursed_xp_scroll":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"Ignorance Curse","t":"When your period reaches a certain stage, experience may not be very useful except for being used for others, but now, through the power of curse, the nature of this scroll has undergone a huge change.<br2/>The greedy curse of ignorance expands the hunting range of the scroll and devours most o…"},"enigmaticaddons:forger_gem":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"Forger's Gem","t":"Forging items is an inevitable step to strength enhancement, but before reach the perfection, there will always be concerns due to expensive costs or anvil breakage.<br2/>This accessory will directly inject ancient forging techniques into your hands, effectively reducing the probability of anvi…"},"enigmaticaddons:hell_blade_charm":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"Charm of Hell Blade","t":"This charm seems to have been waiting for your arrival somewhere in nether, waiting for you to nurture it with your own blood.<br2/>Anyone who notices the powerful power this charm gives, even if it honestly indicates the cost, will inevitably be tempted to wear it."},"enigmaticaddons:quartz_ring":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"Magic Quartz Ring","t":"When you discover quartz in the nether, you surprised by its widespread distribution in the nether."},"enigmaticaddons:scorched_charm":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"Charm of Scorched Sun","t":"To purify the power of flames, in addition to protection, we also need more auxiliary abilities.<br2/>Unlike Frost Walker, this charm allows you to walk directly on lava without the need to transform it into other strange objects, making it easier for you to travel in the Nether."},"enigmaticaddons:thunder_scroll":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"Scroll of Thunder","t":"Although the Will of Ocean can partly control the lightning, this is ultimately only indirect control and not fast enough.<br2/>We use the divine power to write spells that resonate with lightning onto scrolls, using spellstone as the foundation and swords as the medium to release the power."},"enigmaticaddons:bless_ring":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"The Choice of Rebirth","t":"When you are hesitating whether to sacrifice yourself to break free from the Seven Curse Ring, there is a brand new choice in front of you.<br2/>The biggest problem is the Loss of Soul, and with the current materials and methods, it seems impossible."},"enigmaticaddons:etherium_core":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"Etherium Core","t":"One is the Heart of Golem, which can be seen everywhere in the world, and the other is the extremely precious Etherium Armor."},"enigmaticaddons:forgotten_ice":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"Forgotten Ice Crystal","t":"When it comes to Spellstones, names that represent flames, void, and so on will occupy people's minds, but in the distant snowy plains, there is still a force waiting for you to excavate.<br2/>This spellstone awakens the power of freezing, and the frozen air slows down the fast-moving things ar…"},"enigmaticaddons:lost_engine":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"Lost Engine","t":"When you discover this spellstone, it still silently drives in the corner.<br2/>This ancient spellstone, with engine energy from the old era, can enhance your mobility and resistance, allowing you to increase your power by almost four times after squatting, while also being able to jet air to r…"},"enigmaticaddons:disaster_sword":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"Disaster Broadsword","t":"With a sturdy blade and a soul poised to take off, this sword showcases the skills of defense and counterattack.<br2/>Holding this broadsword, you can use its wide blade to block almost all attacks."},"enigmaticaddons:dragon_bow":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"The Dragon Breath","t":"Can Dragon Breath only be used for brewing? You may have thought about this issue. Recalling the ender dragon using its deadly dragon breath to burn your armor and skin, you also want others to experience it."},"enigmaticaddons:evil_dagger":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"The Curse Carver","t":"A mysterious weapon crafted from Nefarious Ingot, with endless evil thoughts gathered at the tip of the blade, greedily waiting for the soul to feast.<br2/>As its name suggests, The Curse Carver is able to imprint a unique curse on your soul."},"enigmaticdelicacy:hungry_charm":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"Mark of Self-discipline","t":"The idea of using food to make charms first appeared in my mind. Let's give it a try.<br2/>But the result was somewhat unexpected. Such a charm cannot make people enjoy delicious food, but rather need to control their hunger."},"enigmaticdelicacy:weapon_charm":{"b":"The Acknowledgment","e":"Glory of Weapon Master","t":"Different weapons have different combat style, and there should be different ways to strengthen them according to different situations.<br2/>This shining charm cast from multiple sharp weapons, which will give you different strengthening methods based on your main weapon."},"goety:black_iron_boots":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Black Iron Armor","t":"Cursed Metal Ingots seems to have the same properties as regular Iron Ingots, making it redundant to make an armor set based on it. However, with some tinkering, the ingots can be used to upgrade the regular Iron Armor to something better."},"goety:black_iron_leggings":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Black Iron Armor","t":"Cursed Metal Ingots seems to have the same properties as regular Iron Ingots, making it redundant to make an armor set based on it. However, with some tinkering, the ingots can be used to upgrade the regular Iron Armor to something better."},"goety:black_iron_chestplate":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Black Iron Armor","t":"Cursed Metal Ingots seems to have the same properties as regular Iron Ingots, making it redundant to make an armor set based on it. However, with some tinkering, the ingots can be used to upgrade the regular Iron Armor to something better."},"goety:black_iron_helmet":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Black Iron Armor","t":"Cursed Metal Ingots seems to have the same properties as regular Iron Ingots, making it redundant to make an armor set based on it. However, with some tinkering, the ingots can be used to upgrade the regular Iron Armor to something better."},"goety:blade_of_ender":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Blade of Ender","t":"Inspired by your foe, you've crafted a blade using the powers of the void and added some Dark Alloy to grant it the ability to self-repair with Soul Energy."},"goety:bonehead_hammer":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Bonehead Hammer","t":"Fashioned in the likeness of a skull, this hammer pull nearby creatures towards the target of impact when swung at full power. It can perform the same functionalities as it's mundane counterpart. The hammer can be repaired on an anvil with a Cursed Metal Ingot."},"goety:dark_chestplate":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Dark Armor","t":"While Dark Alloy can be used to craft regular tools, when it comes to armor, it seems to require more... elaborate ways of crafting them."},"goety:dark_helmet":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Dark Armor","t":"While Dark Alloy can be used to craft regular tools, when it comes to armor, it seems to require more... elaborate ways of crafting them."},"goety:dark_boots":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Dark Armor","t":"While Dark Alloy can be used to craft regular tools, when it comes to armor, it seems to require more... elaborate ways of crafting them."},"goety:dark_leggings":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Dark Armor","t":"While Dark Alloy can be used to craft regular tools, when it comes to armor, it seems to require more... elaborate ways of crafting them."},"goety:fanged_dagger":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Fanged Dagger","t":"The Fanged Dagger might not seem impressive, but provides high attack speed compared to Swords and poisons targets. When a creature is killed, the bearer gains more Soul Energy than before. The dagger can be repaired on an anvil with a Cursed Metal Ingot."},"goety:great_hammer":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Great Hammer","t":"Blacksmiths and soldiers alike use the Great Hammer for its strength in forging and in battle."},"goety:hungry_dagger":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Hungry Dagger","t":"A version of the Fanged Dagger that, while no longer venomous, will heal the wielder 5%% of damage dealt by it. The lifesteal percentage increases with each Soul Eater enchantment level."},"goety:hunters_bow":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Hunter's Bow","t":"A Bow suited to killing game, any animal slain by an arrow shot from this bow will drop more loot than even a Looting III weapon. The bow can be repaired on an anvil when combined with any bow."},"goety:diamond_ice_axe":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Ice Axes","t":"These pickaxe looking axes are useful at collecting ice and pushing you up over obstacles, though they lack the shield-disabling and wood-stripping abilities of true axes."},"goety:reinforced_ice_axe":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Ice Axes","t":"These pickaxe looking axes are useful at collecting ice and pushing you up over obstacles, though they lack the shield-disabling and wood-stripping abilities of true axes."},"goety:iron_ice_axe":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Ice Axes","t":"These pickaxe looking axes are useful at collecting ice and pushing you up over obstacles, though they lack the shield-disabling and wood-stripping abilities of true axes."},"goety:rampaging_axe":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Rampaging Axe","t":"An axe that hungers for both Blood and Wood. When killing a creature or chopping down wood, the user becomes slightly stronger and their hands move quicker for 10 seconds. Continuous killings/choppings amplifies the effect."},"goety:stormlander":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Stormlander","t":"The Stormlander, enchanted with the power of the raging storm, is a treasure of the Illagers. It can perform the same functionalities as it's mundane counterpart. The hammer can be repaired on an anvil with a Pale Steel Ingot."},"goety:abyss_crown":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Abyss Robes","t":"The Abyss Robes allows you to harness the power of the oceans far more efficiently and effectively. The Robes makes the wearer swim faster, and reduces the damage from drowning, even providing a small amount of air after taking damage."},"goety:abyss_robe":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Abyss Robes","t":"The Abyss Robes allows you to harness the power of the oceans far more efficiently and effectively. The Robes makes the wearer swim faster, and reduces the damage from drowning, even providing a small amount of air after taking damage."},"goety:alarming_charm":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Alarming Charm","t":"When hunting you down, the Illagers tend to signal their approach by having rows of fangs below you, or a Tormentor charging at you. With how sneaky they are, you've managed to devise a charm that would signal their arrival towards you."},"goety:dark_robe":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Dark Robes","t":"Evokers wear such snazzy robes, that you wonder if they're just for show or there's something special about them. By utilizing Dark and Magic Fabrics, you've managed to not only replicate their Robes, but also make some new additions, and discover they hold some special properties."},"goety:dark_hat":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Dark Robes","t":"Evokers wear such snazzy robes, that you wonder if they're just for show or there's something special about them. By utilizing Dark and Magic Fabrics, you've managed to not only replicate their Robes, but also make some new additions, and discover they hold some special properties."},"goety:dark_robe_fancy":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Dark Robes","t":"Evokers wear such snazzy robes, that you wonder if they're just for show or there's something special about them. By utilizing Dark and Magic Fabrics, you've managed to not only replicate their Robes, but also make some new additions, and discover they hold some special properties."},"goety:feline_amulet":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Feline Amulet","t":"The amulet contains the essence of a feline creature on it, making it seemed like the wearer has one on them the whole time, warding off Creepers and Phantoms away."},"goety:frost_robe":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Frost Robes","t":"The Frost Robes imbues the wearer the power of all that's cold. Wearers will never freeze, be resistant to Freezing attacks and can move through Powdered Snow freely. The Robes also makes Frost Spells cheaper."},"goety:frost_robe_cryo":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Frost Robes","t":"The Frost Robes imbues the wearer the power of all that's cold. Wearers will never freeze, be resistant to Freezing attacks and can move through Powdered Snow freely. The Robes also makes Frost Spells cheaper."},"goety:frost_crown":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Frost Robes","t":"The Frost Robes imbues the wearer the power of all that's cold. Wearers will never freeze, be resistant to Freezing attacks and can move through Powdered Snow freely. The Robes also makes Frost Spells cheaper."},"goety:amethyst_necklace":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Geo Robes","t":"With pelts and some magical fabrics, this simple shamanistic robe reduces the soul cost of Geomantic spells by half. Amethysts are powerful conduits to Geomantic magic. By crafting and wearing this necklace, the casting time of Geomantic spells will be reduced by half."},"goety:geo_robe":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Geo Robes","t":"With pelts and some magical fabrics, this simple shamanistic robe reduces the soul cost of Geomantic spells by half. Amethysts are powerful conduits to Geomantic magic. By crafting and wearing this necklace, the casting time of Geomantic spells will be reduced by half."},"goety:grave_glove":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Grave Gloves","t":"Scythes are fun and all, but they're very slow to wield making it hard for them to be a viable weapon. Using the remnants of the dead and Necroturgy, you've managed to create gloves that allow you to wield the Scythes more efficiently, increasing the attack speed by 50%%."},"goety:illusion_robe_mirror":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Illusive Robes","t":"Using the Occult Fabrics, you are able to create a set of Illusive Robes that will make you immune to Blindness effect and turn invisible when you do, making you highly undetectable to mobs and others of your kind."},"goety:illusion_robe":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Illusive Robes","t":"Using the Occult Fabrics, you are able to create a set of Illusive Robes that will make you immune to Blindness effect and turn invisible when you do, making you highly undetectable to mobs and others of your kind."},"goety:nameless_crown":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Nameless Set","t":"After discovering the most hidden of necromantic ways, you've devised a new set of garb to showcase your mastery over the dark arts. The set functions the same as the old Necro Set with some improvements and does not give the wearer debuffs when under sunlight."},"goety:nameless_cape":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Nameless Set","t":"After discovering the most hidden of necromantic ways, you've devised a new set of garb to showcase your mastery over the dark arts. The set functions the same as the old Necro Set with some improvements and does not give the wearer debuffs when under sunlight."},"goety:necro_cape":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Necromancer","t":"The scroll contains some instruction on granting, or calling forth, intelligence to the long diseased, allowing you to create and command undead Necromancers from Skeletons. The Necromancers can be taught to summon more than just Zombies."},"goety:necro_crown":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Necromancer Set","t":"The power of commanding Zombies and Skeletons sounds wonderful, but with the power of the Necro Cape, your Necroturgic abilities enhance even further. Wearing it causes your Skeletons' arrows to pass through allied creatures, and Zombies can turn wild Zombies into more Servants that obeys you."},"goety:nether_robe_warped":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Nether Robes","t":"With the growing knowledge of the Nether, you've managed to craft a robe that imbues the wearer with its flames. Wearers will be resistant to fire attacks and extinguish fire from them more quickly."},"goety:nether_robe":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Nether Robes","t":"With the growing knowledge of the Nether, you've managed to craft a robe that imbues the wearer with its flames. Wearers will be resistant to fire attacks and extinguish fire from them more quickly."},"goety:nether_crown":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Nether Robes","t":"With the growing knowledge of the Nether, you've managed to craft a robe that imbues the wearer with its flames. Wearers will be resistant to fire attacks and extinguish fire from them more quickly."},"goety:ominous_charm":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Ominous Charm","t":"When killing a Patrol Captain, you'll always get cursed with Bad Omen, which can be useful at times, but annoying and detrimental as well."},"goety:pendant_of_hunger":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Pendant of Hunger","t":"The Pendant of Hunger absorbs any Rotten Flesh in your inventory, storing them within itself and uses it to automatically feed you once you are feeling a bit peckish. Of course, eating such food leaves you more hungry than before."},"goety:ring_of_the_dragon":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Ring of the Dragon","t":"The Ring of the Dragon, when worn, powers up the breath spells, Fire and Frost, that not only increases their damage, but also affects the terrain itself!"},"goety:ring_of_the_forge":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Ring of the Forge","t":"When summoning a Zombie or Skeleton Servants, they have a small chance of coming equipped with their own armor. With this ring, the chance will increase to 100%%. If 'illagerServantTrainArmor' is enabled, wearing this ring will cause newly trained Illagers to gain armor."},"goety:ring_of_thirst":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Ring of Thirst","t":"The Eerie Pickaxe might be useful for collecting Experience Orbs, there are times where even that ability is not enough. With this ring, experience is immediately given to the wearer if it's dropped by killing a creature, personally or through a servant."},"goety:ring_of_want":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Ring of Want","t":"The Ring of Want allows creatures to drop more loot when slain by your spells or by creatures conjured up by you. For the Ring to work, you must enchant it, where it will accept the Wanting Enchantment which functions similar to Looting."},"goety:sea_amulet":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Sea Amulet","t":"The Sea Amulet provides the effect Conduit Power towards the wearer whenever they're underwater, using up its inner charges. In order to charge the amulet, the wearer must be 8 blocks near an active Conduit underwater."},"goety:spiteful_belt":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Spiteful Belt","t":"You have crafted a Belt that specializes in hurting your attackers when taking damage. While it does not wear down like what Thorn Enchantment does to armor, it does use the wearer's Soul Energy when doing this. It can be enchanted with Thorns to increase damage."},"goety:star_amulet":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Soul Shield Amulet","t":"The Soul Shield Amulet mimics the Wither's shield when its power has ebbed. Should its wearer be half or less of their maximum health, arrows will bounced off them. Should one be capable of Creative Flight without being in Creative, they will find themselves grounded when the shield is up."},"goety:storm_crown":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Storm Robes","t":"A variant of the Wind Robes that takes the very lightning in its fabrics. Much like the Wind Robes, the robes allows you to fall slowly. Wearing the Robes also halves the Soul Cost for Storm Spells, but not Wind Spells unfortunately."},"goety:storm_robe":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Storm Robes","t":"A variant of the Wind Robes that takes the very lightning in its fabrics. Much like the Wind Robes, the robes allows you to fall slowly. Wearing the Robes also halves the Soul Cost for Storm Spells, but not Wind Spells unfortunately."},"goety:targeting_monocle":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Targeting Monocle","t":"Trying to hit your foes with your spells can be an ordeal as they could avoid your Magical Fangs with but a single step. With this monocle, you can lock onto nearby foes by pressing the 'Activate Curio' key, allowing you to more accurately hit them with a spell."},"goety:thrash_glove":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Thrash Gloves","t":"Hammers are quite heavy for a dark wizard such as yourself. Fortunately, with your crafting and forging expertise, you've discovered a way to create a pair of gloves that helps you to wield Hammers more efficiently, increasing the attack speed by 50%%."},"goety:unholy_hat":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Unholy Robes","t":"Using the purest blood of the dark emissary, which can only be obtained by slaying them within the Nether, you've made replica of their garments. The Robes gives you immunity to fire and Burn Hexes, and both robe and hat empowers some spells with hellfire."},"goety:unholy_hat_halo":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Unholy Robes","t":"Using the purest blood of the dark emissary, which can only be obtained by slaying them within the Nether, you've made replica of their garments. The Robes gives you immunity to fire and Burn Hexes, and both robe and hat empowers some spells with hellfire."},"goety:unholy_robe":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Unholy Robes","t":"Using the purest blood of the dark emissary, which can only be obtained by slaying them within the Nether, you've made replica of their garments. The Robes gives you immunity to fire and Burn Hexes, and both robe and hat empowers some spells with hellfire."},"goety:void_crown":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Void Robes","t":"The Void Robes imbues the wearer the power of the End. Wearers will have the chance of dodge attacks through teleportation, be immune to Void Touched and can move through Void Blocks freely. The Robes also makes Void Spells cheaper."},"goety:void_robe":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Void Robes","t":"The Void Robes imbues the wearer the power of the End. Wearers will have the chance of dodge attacks through teleportation, be immune to Void Touched and can move through Void Blocks freely. The Robes also makes Void Spells cheaper."},"goety:wayfarers_belt":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Wayfarer's Belt","t":"The Wayfarer's Belt allows the wearer to not only move a bit faster, but also allows them to walk up a single block without jumping. The Belt also increases the jump height of the wearer and halves damage caused by falling off high places."},"goety:wild_robe":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Wild Robes","t":"The Wild Robes allows you to harness the power of nature far more efficiently and effectively. Servants that spews poison, for instance, will instead give Acid Venom, which affects even the Undead. Consequently, the Robes also provides immunity to poison and said venom!"},"goety:wild_crown":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Wild Robes","t":"The Wild Robes allows you to harness the power of nature far more efficiently and effectively. Servants that spews poison, for instance, will instead give Acid Venom, which affects even the Undead. Consequently, the Robes also provides immunity to poison and said venom!"},"goety:wind_crown":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Wind Robes","t":"The Wind Robes allows you to fall slowly(or not so slowly when holding shift) and make you immune to fall damage. However, every second the robes slow your fall, Soul Energy is consumed. Wearing the Robes also halves the Soul Cost for Wind Spells."},"goety:wind_robe":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Wind Robes","t":"The Wind Robes allows you to fall slowly(or not so slowly when holding shift) and make you immune to fall damage. However, every second the robes slow your fall, Soul Energy is consumed. Wearing the Robes also halves the Soul Cost for Wind Spells."},"goety:witch_robe":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Witches Set","t":"Witches are known to look snazzy with their massive hats. You've figured out how to make your own Witch hat with some Dark Fabrics and you've discovered how wearing them gives you a small chance of not consuming any potion."},"goety:witch_robe_hedge":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Witches Set","t":"Witches are known to look snazzy with their massive hats. You've figured out how to make your own Witch hat with some Dark Fabrics and you've discovered how wearing them gives you a small chance of not consuming any potion."},"goety:witch_hat_hedge":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Witches Set","t":"Witches are known to look snazzy with their massive hats. You've figured out how to make your own Witch hat with some Dark Fabrics and you've discovered how wearing them gives you a small chance of not consuming any potion."},"goety:witch_hat":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Witches Set","t":"Witches are known to look snazzy with their massive hats. You've figured out how to make your own Witch hat with some Dark Fabrics and you've discovered how wearing them gives you a small chance of not consuming any potion."},"goety:totem_of_souls":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Magical Components","t":"With your primitive Totem in hand, you've discovered that you can use it to craft brand new items that can be used to create all kinds of magical contraptions and focus! Though surely there's a more cheaper way of getting these items..."},"goety:crone_hat":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Crones","t":"Older and wiser, yet still malicious, Witches that have created and utilize far greater brews than their lesser kin. Their Hats are said to help make extra witch brews. Deals damage when getting hit."},"cataclysm:ancient_spear":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Wadjet","t":"Through a simple Koboleton, you've managed to call forth a great Wadjet and have it serve under your thumb. The undead spellcaster can be healed by feeding it bones, and can passively heal if their owner dons a Necro Cape."},"cataclysm:monstrous_helm":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Netherite Monstrosity","t":"While the Redstone Monstrosity is one of the most powerful servants you can field, perhaps, with the power of the Infernal Forge, you'll be able to replicate its Netherite counterpart. Right click the center Reinforced Redstone Block with an Infernal Forge."},"goetydelight:dark_knife":{"b":"The Black Book","e":"Dark Knife","t":"An upgraded version of the Cursed Metal Blade, inherently equipped with Soul Mending. Attacks inflict 5s of Corrosion effect, with all damage dealt multiplied by 1.5x."},"industrialforegoing:meat_feeder":{"b":"Industrial Foregoing's Manual","e":"Meat Feeder","t":"When in your inventory the Meat Feeder will feed you with the liquid meat stored inside of the tool."},"irons_spellbooks:copper_spell_book":{"b":"Iron's Guidebook","e":"Basic Spell Books","t":"Many spell Books can be crafted from a combination of vanilla and arcane materials. Each further tier crafted increases the slot count of the spell book and often comes with extra bonuses, increasing the power and quantity of spells it can contain."},"irons_spellbooks:dragonskin_spell_book":{"b":"Iron's Guidebook","e":"Basic Spell Books","t":"Many spell Books can be crafted from a combination of vanilla and arcane materials. Each further tier crafted increases the slot count of the spell book and often comes with extra bonuses, increasing the power and quantity of spells it can contain."},"irons_spellbooks:netherite_spell_book":{"b":"Iron's Guidebook","e":"Basic Spell Books","t":"Many spell Books can be crafted from a combination of vanilla and arcane materials. Each further tier crafted increases the slot count of the spell book and often comes with extra bonuses, increasing the power and quantity of spells it can contain."},"irons_spellbooks:pyromancer_helmet":{"b":"Iron's Guidebook","e":"Late Game","t":"Late game is reached by obtaining netherite and vast quantities of basic resources, and powered by the Arcane Anvil. The Arcane Anvil is the most powerful crafting station, used to level up your scrolls, upgrade armor and spell books, and imbue weapons with spells."},"irons_spellbooks:cryomancer_helmet":{"b":"Iron's Guidebook","e":"Late Game","t":"Late game is reached by obtaining netherite and vast quantities of basic resources, and powered by the Arcane Anvil. The Arcane Anvil is the most powerful crafting station, used to level up your scrolls, upgrade armor and spell books, and imbue weapons with spells."},"irons_spellbooks:gold_spell_book":{"b":"Iron's Guidebook","e":"Basic Spell Books","t":"Many spell Books can be crafted from a combination of vanilla and arcane materials. Each further tier crafted increases the slot count of the spell book and often comes with extra bonuses, increasing the power and quantity of spells it can contain."},"irons_spellbooks:diamond_spell_book":{"b":"Iron's Guidebook","e":"Basic Spell Books","t":"Many spell Books can be crafted from a combination of vanilla and arcane materials. Each further tier crafted increases the slot count of the spell book and often comes with extra bonuses, increasing the power and quantity of spells it can contain."},"irons_spellbooks:rotten_spell_book":{"b":"Iron's Guidebook","e":"Basic Spell Books","t":"Many spell Books can be crafted from a combination of vanilla and arcane materials. Each further tier crafted increases the slot count of the spell book and often comes with extra bonuses, increasing the power and quantity of spells it can contain."},"irons_spellbooks:blaze_spell_book":{"b":"Iron's Guidebook","e":"Basic Spell Books","t":"Many spell Books can be crafted from a combination of vanilla and arcane materials. Each further tier crafted increases the slot count of the spell book and often comes with extra bonuses, increasing the power and quantity of spells it can contain."},"irons_spellbooks:villager_spell_book":{"b":"Iron's Guidebook","e":"Basic Spell Books","t":"Many spell Books can be crafted from a combination of vanilla and arcane materials. Each further tier crafted increases the slot count of the spell book and often comes with extra bonuses, increasing the power and quantity of spells it can contain."},"irons_spellbooks:iron_spell_book":{"b":"Iron's Guidebook","e":"Basic Spell Books","t":"Many spell Books can be crafted from a combination of vanilla and arcane materials. Each further tier crafted increases the slot count of the spell book and often comes with extra bonuses, increasing the power and quantity of spells it can contain."},"irons_spellbooks:druidic_spell_book":{"b":"Iron's Guidebook","e":"Basic Spell Books","t":"Many spell Books can be crafted from a combination of vanilla and arcane materials. Each further tier crafted increases the slot count of the spell book and often comes with extra bonuses, increasing the power and quantity of spells it can contain."},"irons_spellbooks:necronomicon_spell_book":{"b":"Iron's Guidebook","e":"Unique Spell Books","t":"Unique spell books are rare drops from certain mobs that come with spells inscribed, which cannot be removed or edited. Not every spell book can be manufactured -- it is called the arcane art, after all. The spells in a unique spell book are locked, but can be improved."},"irons_spellbooks:evoker_spell_book":{"b":"Iron's Guidebook","e":"Unique Spell Books","t":"Unique spell books are rare drops from certain mobs that come with spells inscribed, which cannot be removed or edited. Not every spell book can be manufactured -- it is called the arcane art, after all. The spells in a unique spell book are locked, but can be improved."},"simplymore:brassturn":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Brassturn [SM]","t":"Item Added In Simply More A prototype for the mechanical marvel which would have been used by a Steampunk society's greatest warriors and protectors."},"simplymore:exedrill":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Exedrill [SM]","t":"Item Added In Simply More The ground shakes as the drill bores through solid stone. Exedrill had started off as a simple tool, a resource gatherer for the Steampunk Society. It was not until the royal mechanic decided it could have other uses that it became what it is now."},"simplymore:jester_penetrate":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Jester Penetrate [SM]","t":"Item Added In Simply More He’s the DEADLIEST minecraft player on the DEADLIEST minecraft smp - The Heart Transplant SMP!"},"simplymore:matterbane":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Matterbane [SM]","t":"Item Added In Simply More Created in mass to kill a rogue parasite, this weapon was given to as many people in their secret society as possible."},"simplymore:holylight":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Ruptured Idol [SM]","t":"Item Added In Simply More The former signature weapon of the Great Sage, now left decaying. Before his passing, this weapon was used to keep the Nether from expanding into the Overworld, and now is the only thing stopping their expanse."},"simplymore:darksent":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Ruptured Idol [SM]","t":"Item Added In Simply More The former signature weapon of the Great Sage, now left decaying. Before his passing, this weapon was used to keep the Nether from expanding into the Overworld, and now is the only thing stopping their expanse."},"simplymore:ascended_idol":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Ruptured Idol [SM]","t":"Item Added In Simply More The former signature weapon of the Great Sage, now left decaying. Before his passing, this weapon was used to keep the Nether from expanding into the Overworld, and now is the only thing stopping their expanse."},"simplymore:ruptured_idol":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Ruptured Idol [SM]","t":"Item Added In Simply More The former signature weapon of the Great Sage, now left decaying. Before his passing, this weapon was used to keep the Nether from expanding into the Overworld, and now is the only thing stopping their expanse."},"simplymore:tarnished_idol":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Ruptured Idol [SM]","t":"Item Added In Simply More The former signature weapon of the Great Sage, now left decaying. Before his passing, this weapon was used to keep the Nether from expanding into the Overworld, and now is the only thing stopping their expanse."},"simplymore:ruyi_jingu_bang":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Ruyi Jingu Bang [SM]","t":"Item Added In Simply More As Sun Wukong asked the Dragon King for a blade fit for someone of his power, the Dragon King cunningly points towards the useless pillar sat in his treasury."},"simplymore:serpentine_valour":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Serpentine Valour [SM]","t":"Item Added In Simply More Serpentine Valour is a weapon that feeds off the triumph of its wielder, growing ever stronger. It was stolen many times by warriors bloodthirsty for its raw power. This weapon creates a slick substance upon its blade, delivering a stinging pain when touched."},"simplymore:the_blood_harvester":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"The Blood Harvester [SM]","t":"Item Added In Simply More This blade once had a formidable place in a vicious Berserker's arsenal before it was abandoned, having fulfilled its use."},"simplymore:tidebreaker":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Tidebreaker [SM]","t":"Item Added In Simply More When the Drowned God fell into the deep for the last time, he left this artefact behind to remember his legacy. Being remotely close to this unique causes hallucinations and paranoia, and wielding it can cause mindbreaking levels of insanity."},"simplymore:iron_backhand_blade":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Backhand Blade [SM]","t":"Item Added In Simply More A slick blade designed to be held secretively behind you, consealing the blade before it is too late to react to your strike. Commonly used by assassins, backhand blades boast a very fast, precise swing."},"simplymore:iron_dagger":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Dagger [SM]","t":"Item Added In Simply More Daggers are usually regarded as unsophisticated weaponry, used by the most incompetent of warriors. It is hard to dispute the fact, however, that those who face the wrath of the mighty dagger do not usually last long enough to think of that fact."},"simplymore:iron_khopesh":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Khopesh [SM]","t":"Item Added In Simply More A common weapon in ancient egypt, the khopesh can be found in graves of Pharohs long past. Khopeshs were usually used for vanity as well as warfare, a display of wealth and prosperity."},"simplymore:iron_lance":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Lance [SM]","t":"Item Added In Simply More Commonly used in the olden era, it was said lances were used to pierce and pull people along the ground as the wielder ran around on horseback. While weilded without a secondary armament in the other hand and while on a mount, lances gain a boost in damage."},"simplyswords:netherite_warglaive":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Warglaive","t":"Warglaives are known for their speed and agility and with their razor-sharp edges, they can deliver swift and deadly strikes. They require a high level of dexterity and skill to wield effectively, but when used correctly they can be very effective in battle."},"simplyswords:runic_warglaive":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Warglaive","t":"Warglaives are known for their speed and agility and with their razor-sharp edges, they can deliver swift and deadly strikes. They require a high level of dexterity and skill to wield effectively, but when used correctly they can be very effective in battle."},"simplyswords:gold_warglaive":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Warglaive","t":"Warglaives are known for their speed and agility and with their razor-sharp edges, they can deliver swift and deadly strikes. They require a high level of dexterity and skill to wield effectively, but when used correctly they can be very effective in battle."},"simplyswords:diamond_warglaive":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Warglaive","t":"Warglaives are known for their speed and agility and with their razor-sharp edges, they can deliver swift and deadly strikes. They require a high level of dexterity and skill to wield effectively, but when used correctly they can be very effective in battle."},"simplyswords:iron_warglaive":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Warglaive","t":"Warglaives are known for their speed and agility and with their razor-sharp edges, they can deliver swift and deadly strikes. They require a high level of dexterity and skill to wield effectively, but when used correctly they can be very effective in battle."},"simplyswords:iron_spear":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Spear","t":"Spears have been used throughout history as a weapon for hunting and warfare. They are known for their versatility and range, and are primarily used for thrusting. They are also relatively simple to make and maintain, making them a popular weapon among ancient and primitive cultures."},"simplyswords:runic_spear":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Spear","t":"Spears have been used throughout history as a weapon for hunting and warfare. They are known for their versatility and range, and are primarily used for thrusting. They are also relatively simple to make and maintain, making them a popular weapon among ancient and primitive cultures."},"simplyswords:diamond_spear":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Spear","t":"Spears have been used throughout history as a weapon for hunting and warfare. They are known for their versatility and range, and are primarily used for thrusting. They are also relatively simple to make and maintain, making them a popular weapon among ancient and primitive cultures."},"simplyswords:netherite_spear":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Spear","t":"Spears have been used throughout history as a weapon for hunting and warfare. They are known for their versatility and range, and are primarily used for thrusting. They are also relatively simple to make and maintain, making them a popular weapon among ancient and primitive cultures."},"simplyswords:gold_spear":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Spear","t":"Spears have been used throughout history as a weapon for hunting and warfare. They are known for their versatility and range, and are primarily used for thrusting. They are also relatively simple to make and maintain, making them a popular weapon among ancient and primitive cultures."},"simplyswords:netherite_scythe":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Scythe","t":"The Scythe is known for its ability to deliver devastating damage with each strike, due to its weight and sharpened blade. The Scythe can be used for cutting and slicing attacks in a wide radius, thanks to its particularly large curved blade and long handle."},"simplyswords:gold_scythe":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Scythe","t":"The Scythe is known for its ability to deliver devastating damage with each strike, due to its weight and sharpened blade. The Scythe can be used for cutting and slicing attacks in a wide radius, thanks to its particularly large curved blade and long handle."},"simplyswords:diamond_scythe":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Scythe","t":"The Scythe is known for its ability to deliver devastating damage with each strike, due to its weight and sharpened blade. The Scythe can be used for cutting and slicing attacks in a wide radius, thanks to its particularly large curved blade and long handle."},"simplyswords:iron_scythe":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Scythe","t":"The Scythe is known for its ability to deliver devastating damage with each strike, due to its weight and sharpened blade. The Scythe can be used for cutting and slicing attacks in a wide radius, thanks to its particularly large curved blade and long handle."},"simplyswords:runic_scythe":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Scythe","t":"The Scythe is known for its ability to deliver devastating damage with each strike, due to its weight and sharpened blade. The Scythe can be used for cutting and slicing attacks in a wide radius, thanks to its particularly large curved blade and long handle."},"simplyswords:netherite_rapier":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Rapier","t":"Rapiers were popular among the upper class during the 16th and 17th centuries, and were used in duels and civilian self-defense. Rapiers are known for their speed, precision, and elegance in combat."},"simplyswords:diamond_rapier":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Rapier","t":"Rapiers were popular among the upper class during the 16th and 17th centuries, and were used in duels and civilian self-defense. Rapiers are known for their speed, precision, and elegance in combat."},"simplyswords:iron_rapier":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Rapier","t":"Rapiers were popular among the upper class during the 16th and 17th centuries, and were used in duels and civilian self-defense. Rapiers are known for their speed, precision, and elegance in combat."},"simplyswords:runic_rapier":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Rapier","t":"Rapiers were popular among the upper class during the 16th and 17th centuries, and were used in duels and civilian self-defense. Rapiers are known for their speed, precision, and elegance in combat."},"simplyswords:gold_rapier":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Rapier","t":"Rapiers were popular among the upper class during the 16th and 17th centuries, and were used in duels and civilian self-defense. Rapiers are known for their speed, precision, and elegance in combat."},"simplyswords:runic_longsword":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Longsword","t":"The longsword is a versatile weapon that can be used for cutting, thrusting, and slicing. It was widely used by knights and other soldiers during the medieval period."},"simplyswords:netherite_longsword":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Longsword","t":"The longsword is a versatile weapon that can be used for cutting, thrusting, and slicing. It was widely used by knights and other soldiers during the medieval period."},"simplyswords:diamond_longsword":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Longsword","t":"The longsword is a versatile weapon that can be used for cutting, thrusting, and slicing. It was widely used by knights and other soldiers during the medieval period."},"simplyswords:iron_longsword":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Longsword","t":"The longsword is a versatile weapon that can be used for cutting, thrusting, and slicing. It was widely used by knights and other soldiers during the medieval period."},"simplyswords:gold_longsword":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Longsword","t":"The longsword is a versatile weapon that can be used for cutting, thrusting, and slicing. It was widely used by knights and other soldiers during the medieval period."},"simplyswords:iron_katana":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Katana","t":"The Katana is known for its sharpness, strength, and ability to be wielded with great speed and precision. It was traditionally used by the samurai class of feudal Japan and it was considered one of the most important weapons of the samurai."},"simplyswords:gold_katana":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Katana","t":"The Katana is known for its sharpness, strength, and ability to be wielded with great speed and precision. It was traditionally used by the samurai class of feudal Japan and it was considered one of the most important weapons of the samurai."},"simplyswords:runic_katana":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Katana","t":"The Katana is known for its sharpness, strength, and ability to be wielded with great speed and precision. It was traditionally used by the samurai class of feudal Japan and it was considered one of the most important weapons of the samurai."},"simplyswords:diamond_katana":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Katana","t":"The Katana is known for its sharpness, strength, and ability to be wielded with great speed and precision. It was traditionally used by the samurai class of feudal Japan and it was considered one of the most important weapons of the samurai."},"simplyswords:netherite_katana":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Katana","t":"The Katana is known for its sharpness, strength, and ability to be wielded with great speed and precision. It was traditionally used by the samurai class of feudal Japan and it was considered one of the most important weapons of the samurai."},"simplyswords:netherite_greathammer":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Greathammer","t":"The Greathammer is known for its ability to deliver devastating damage with each strike, due to its weight and size. It was traditionally used by infantry and heavy cavalry in medieval warfare, and it was also used by blacksmiths, masons, and other laborers for heavy-duty striking."},"simplyswords:gold_greathammer":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Greathammer","t":"The Greathammer is known for its ability to deliver devastating damage with each strike, due to its weight and size. It was traditionally used by infantry and heavy cavalry in medieval warfare, and it was also used by blacksmiths, masons, and other laborers for heavy-duty striking."},"simplyswords:runic_greathammer":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Greathammer","t":"The Greathammer is known for its ability to deliver devastating damage with each strike, due to its weight and size. It was traditionally used by infantry and heavy cavalry in medieval warfare, and it was also used by blacksmiths, masons, and other laborers for heavy-duty striking."},"simplyswords:diamond_greathammer":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Greathammer","t":"The Greathammer is known for its ability to deliver devastating damage with each strike, due to its weight and size. It was traditionally used by infantry and heavy cavalry in medieval warfare, and it was also used by blacksmiths, masons, and other laborers for heavy-duty striking."},"simplyswords:iron_greathammer":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Greathammer","t":"The Greathammer is known for its ability to deliver devastating damage with each strike, due to its weight and size. It was traditionally used by infantry and heavy cavalry in medieval warfare, and it was also used by blacksmiths, masons, and other laborers for heavy-duty striking."},"simplyswords:diamond_greataxe":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Greataxe","t":"The greataxe requires a high level of strength and skill to wield effectively. It is a two-handed weapon, which means that the wielder uses both hands to hold and swing the weapon. It's also known for its versatility as it can be used for chopping, slicing, and crushing attacks."},"simplyswords:runic_greataxe":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Greataxe","t":"The greataxe requires a high level of strength and skill to wield effectively. It is a two-handed weapon, which means that the wielder uses both hands to hold and swing the weapon. It's also known for its versatility as it can be used for chopping, slicing, and crushing attacks."},"simplyswords:gold_greataxe":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Greataxe","t":"The greataxe requires a high level of strength and skill to wield effectively. It is a two-handed weapon, which means that the wielder uses both hands to hold and swing the weapon. It's also known for its versatility as it can be used for chopping, slicing, and crushing attacks."},"simplyswords:iron_greataxe":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Greataxe","t":"The greataxe requires a high level of strength and skill to wield effectively. It is a two-handed weapon, which means that the wielder uses both hands to hold and swing the weapon. It's also known for its versatility as it can be used for chopping, slicing, and crushing attacks."},"simplyswords:netherite_greataxe":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Greataxe","t":"The greataxe requires a high level of strength and skill to wield effectively. It is a two-handed weapon, which means that the wielder uses both hands to hold and swing the weapon. It's also known for its versatility as it can be used for chopping, slicing, and crushing attacks."},"simplyswords:runic_glaive":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Glaive","t":"A glaive is a type of polearm weapon that consists of a single-edged blade mounted on the end of a long pole or shaft, ideal for slicing or cutting. The design of the glaive allows for long reach in combat, making it useful for both attacking and defending."},"simplyswords:iron_glaive":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Glaive","t":"A glaive is a type of polearm weapon that consists of a single-edged blade mounted on the end of a long pole or shaft, ideal for slicing or cutting. The design of the glaive allows for long reach in combat, making it useful for both attacking and defending."},"simplyswords:diamond_glaive":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Glaive","t":"A glaive is a type of polearm weapon that consists of a single-edged blade mounted on the end of a long pole or shaft, ideal for slicing or cutting. The design of the glaive allows for long reach in combat, making it useful for both attacking and defending."},"simplyswords:netherite_glaive":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Glaive","t":"A glaive is a type of polearm weapon that consists of a single-edged blade mounted on the end of a long pole or shaft, ideal for slicing or cutting. The design of the glaive allows for long reach in combat, making it useful for both attacking and defending."},"simplyswords:gold_glaive":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Glaive","t":"A glaive is a type of polearm weapon that consists of a single-edged blade mounted on the end of a long pole or shaft, ideal for slicing or cutting. The design of the glaive allows for long reach in combat, making it useful for both attacking and defending."},"simplyswords:runic_cutlass":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Cutlass","t":"The Cutlass is designed for both cutting and thrusting attacks, and it was widely used in close-quarters combat on ships and boats, making it a formidable weapon for naval warfare. Its curved shape allows for powerful, slicing attacks, making it effective against both flesh and rope."},"simplyswords:iron_cutlass":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Cutlass","t":"The Cutlass is designed for both cutting and thrusting attacks, and it was widely used in close-quarters combat on ships and boats, making it a formidable weapon for naval warfare. Its curved shape allows for powerful, slicing attacks, making it effective against both flesh and rope."},"simplyswords:diamond_cutlass":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Cutlass","t":"The Cutlass is designed for both cutting and thrusting attacks, and it was widely used in close-quarters combat on ships and boats, making it a formidable weapon for naval warfare. Its curved shape allows for powerful, slicing attacks, making it effective against both flesh and rope."},"simplyswords:netherite_cutlass":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Cutlass","t":"The Cutlass is designed for both cutting and thrusting attacks, and it was widely used in close-quarters combat on ships and boats, making it a formidable weapon for naval warfare. Its curved shape allows for powerful, slicing attacks, making it effective against both flesh and rope."},"simplyswords:gold_cutlass":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Cutlass","t":"The Cutlass is designed for both cutting and thrusting attacks, and it was widely used in close-quarters combat on ships and boats, making it a formidable weapon for naval warfare. Its curved shape allows for powerful, slicing attacks, making it effective against both flesh and rope."},"simplyswords:runic_claymore":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Claymore","t":"The Claymore is designed for both cutting and thrusting attacks and it was used by Scottish warriors in battle. Its size and weight make it a powerful weapon that can deliver devastating blows to an enemy."},"simplyswords:gold_claymore":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Claymore","t":"The Claymore is designed for both cutting and thrusting attacks and it was used by Scottish warriors in battle. Its size and weight make it a powerful weapon that can deliver devastating blows to an enemy."},"simplyswords:diamond_claymore":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Claymore","t":"The Claymore is designed for both cutting and thrusting attacks and it was used by Scottish warriors in battle. Its size and weight make it a powerful weapon that can deliver devastating blows to an enemy."},"simplyswords:iron_claymore":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Claymore","t":"The Claymore is designed for both cutting and thrusting attacks and it was used by Scottish warriors in battle. Its size and weight make it a powerful weapon that can deliver devastating blows to an enemy."},"simplyswords:netherite_claymore":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Claymore","t":"The Claymore is designed for both cutting and thrusting attacks and it was used by Scottish warriors in battle. Its size and weight make it a powerful weapon that can deliver devastating blows to an enemy."},"simplyswords:iron_chakram":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Chakram","t":"The Chakram is a circular throwing weapon that is typically made of metal and has a sharp outer edge. When duel wielded, the Chakram has the ability to launch an area attack, meaning that it can hit multiple enemies at once around the wielder."},"simplyswords:netherite_chakram":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Chakram","t":"The Chakram is a circular throwing weapon that is typically made of metal and has a sharp outer edge. When duel wielded, the Chakram has the ability to launch an area attack, meaning that it can hit multiple enemies at once around the wielder."},"simplyswords:diamond_chakram":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Chakram","t":"The Chakram is a circular throwing weapon that is typically made of metal and has a sharp outer edge. When duel wielded, the Chakram has the ability to launch an area attack, meaning that it can hit multiple enemies at once around the wielder."},"simplyswords:gold_chakram":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Chakram","t":"The Chakram is a circular throwing weapon that is typically made of metal and has a sharp outer edge. When duel wielded, the Chakram has the ability to launch an area attack, meaning that it can hit multiple enemies at once around the wielder."},"simplyswords:runic_chakram":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Chakram","t":"The Chakram is a circular throwing weapon that is typically made of metal and has a sharp outer edge. When duel wielded, the Chakram has the ability to launch an area attack, meaning that it can hit multiple enemies at once around the wielder."},"simplyswords:whisperwind":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Whisperwind","t":"Whisperwind, the ethereal blade that dances with the wind, grants its wielder unparalleled agility and an enigmatic power. As the katana slices through the air, a faint melody resonates, as if carried by a gentle breeze."},"simplyswords:waxweaver":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Waxweaver","t":"Waxweaver is an exquisite claymore that seamlessly melds elegance with lethality, reminiscent of an ornate candelabra. When Waxweaver strikes ignited enemies, the candles are empowered and their strength is imparted on the wielder."},"simplyswords:stormbringer":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Stormbringer","t":"The sword's split blade is imbued with a powerful electrical energy that crackles and arcs with each strike. The sword is said to be particularly effective when used in battle during a storm, where the wielder can harness the full power of the lightning."},"simplyswords:soulrender":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Soulrender","t":"The Soulrender's blade is said to be crafted from a mysterious black metal that glows with a sinister energy, and it is said to be able to cut through not just flesh and bone, but also the very essence of a being."},"simplyswords:soulkeeper":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Soulkeeper","t":"The Soulkeeper is said to be crafted from a mysterious material that is able to absorb the souls of the fallen, creating a bond between the wielder and the souls. The souls that are absorbed by the hammer act as a protective shield, absorbing some of the damage dealt to the wielder."},"simplyswords:waking_lichblade":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Slumbering Lichblade","t":"The Slumbering Lichblade is a greatsword that exudes an aura of tormented souls that damages enemies that come too close. The sword is said to be crafted from the remains of a powerful Lich, and imbued with the power of the souls it consumed."},"simplyswords:slumbering_lichblade":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Slumbering Lichblade","t":"The Slumbering Lichblade is a greatsword that exudes an aura of tormented souls that damages enemies that come too close. The sword is said to be crafted from the remains of a powerful Lich, and imbued with the power of the souls it consumed."},"simplyswords:awakened_lichblade":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Slumbering Lichblade","t":"The Slumbering Lichblade is a greatsword that exudes an aura of tormented souls that damages enemies that come too close. The sword is said to be crafted from the remains of a powerful Lich, and imbued with the power of the souls it consumed."},"simplyswords:shadowsting":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Shadowsting","t":"Shadowsting is a slender rapier that is imbued with the power of shadows. The rapier's unique ability allows it the chance to deal armor-scaling magic damage to enemies, allowing it to penetrate even the toughest armor."},"simplyswords:molten_edge":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Molten Edge","t":"Molten Edge is a fierce axe that grants its wielder increased strength and haste when they are injured. As the wielder takes damage, the axe becomes more powerful, allowing them to strike harder and faster in battle."},"simplyswords:mjolnir":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Mjolnir","t":"Forged by the dwarves, Brokkr and Eitri, and gifted to the god of thunder, Thor. Mjolnir is a weapon of incredible power, able to level entire mountains in a single strike when wielded by one who is worthy."},"simplyswords:hearthflame":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Hearthflame","t":"Hearthflame is a powerful greathammer imbued with the ability to cause devastating tremors. When swung, it sends out ripples of force that pull enemies towards it before igniting them in a fiery blast."},"simplyswords:frostfall":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Frostfall","t":"Frostfall is a powerful hammer that harnesses the power of ice to freeze its enemies solid. The hammer is crafted from a rare metal that is able to withstand the intense cold of the ice. The hammer head is imbued with the power of ice, allowing it to freeze anything it strikes."},"simplyswords:emberblade":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Emberblade","t":"The Emberblade is a powerful longsword that is imbued with the power of fire. The blade is forged from a rare metal that is able to withstand the intense heat of the flames that surround it. Known to engulf its wielder in flames, The Emberblade can grant increased strength and speed."},"simplyswords:harbinger":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Dormant Relic","t":"The Dormant Relic is a peculiar sword that holds a mysterious secret within its blade. At first glance, it appears to be an ordinary and unremarkable sword, but it possesses dormant energy waiting to be awakened through the process of crafting."},"simplyswords:righteous_relic":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Dormant Relic","t":"The Dormant Relic is a peculiar sword that holds a mysterious secret within its blade. At first glance, it appears to be an ordinary and unremarkable sword, but it possesses dormant energy waiting to be awakened through the process of crafting."},"simplyswords:tainted_relic":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Dormant Relic","t":"The Dormant Relic is a peculiar sword that holds a mysterious secret within its blade. At first glance, it appears to be an ordinary and unremarkable sword, but it possesses dormant energy waiting to be awakened through the process of crafting."},"simplyswords:dormant_relic":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Dormant Relic","t":"The Dormant Relic is a peculiar sword that holds a mysterious secret within its blade. At first glance, it appears to be an ordinary and unremarkable sword, but it possesses dormant energy waiting to be awakened through the process of crafting."},"simplyswords:sunfire":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Dormant Relic","t":"The Dormant Relic is a peculiar sword that holds a mysterious secret within its blade. At first glance, it appears to be an ordinary and unremarkable sword, but it possesses dormant energy waiting to be awakened through the process of crafting."},"simplyswords:caelestis":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Caelestis","t":"A strange weapon with a blade that reveals the astral plane. Grants the wielder the ability to phase into the astral realm, becoming untouchable for brief moments."},"simplyswords:bramblethorn":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Bramblethorn","t":"The Bramblethorn is a unique and deadly rapier that appears to be nothing more than a simple twig, but holds a powerful secret within. Crafted from a rare and enchanted wood that is both lightweight and durable, the Bramblethorn is capable of delivering swift and deadly strikes."},"simplyswords:arcanethyst":{"b":"Runic Grimoire","e":"Arcanethyst","t":"The Arcanethyst is a powerful halberd that harnesses the power of arcane magic to manipulate its enemies, akin to that of telekinesis. The halberd is crafted from enchanted amethyst, a rare and valuable gemstone known for its ability to channel magical energy."},"terramity:gobs_gilded_hat_helmet":{"b":"Terramity Guidebook","e":"Gob, King of Gnomes","t":"'Gob, King of Gnomes' is the first boss in Terramity's progression. He can be found in a 'Court of Gnomes', a structure only found in dark forests and swamps. Recommended Gear: -Diamond/Netherite armor -Strong weapon Can be summoned by right clicking a gold gnome statue with a red gnome hat.","i":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"terramity:gundalfs_hat_helmet":{"b":"Terramity Guidebook","e":"The Shadow Wizards","t":"The 'Shadow Wizards' are the fourth and final boss in Terramity's progression. It can be summoned by using occult fabric on the pedestal found in a Chthonic Cathedral.","i":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"terramity:ring_of_rejuvenation":{"b":"Terramity Guidebook","e":"Accessories","t":"Accessories are an important part of Terramity, and it's also important to experiment to see what works best for you. There are accessories that increase your defense, attack damage, movement speed, abilities, etc."},"terramity:steel_shell":{"b":"Terramity Guidebook","e":"Introduction","t":"Welcome to Terramity! Terramity is a mod that adds a lot of what I feel Minecraft is missing. It takes a lot of inspiration from Terraria and you may notice a lot of references to various games."},"terramity:excalibur":{"b":"Terramity Guidebook","e":"Sword Shrine","t":"The sword shrine is a structure found within the world of Terramity. The structure can be found occasionally poking out into the surface in plains, forests, and mountains. The sword found in the stone can only be pulled by those of a heroic nature.","i":"data:image/webp;base64,"}};
const SIDEB={"Swampjaw":{"entity":"meetyourfight:swampjaw","mod":"Meet Your Fight","find":"Summoned anywhere with Fossil Bait (spider eyes, bones and rotten flesh), easiest in a swamp. It will not summon if another boss is near.","drops":[{"id":"meetyourfight:mossy_tooth","n":"Mossy Tooth","chance":"100%"},{"id":"minecraft:bone","n":"Bone","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Mine drop","desc":"Flies above you and drops three mines that blow up like creepers."},{"name":"Swoop bite","desc":"Dives down to bite you; hitting it first cancels the bite."}],"img_src":null,"sources":["https://ftb.fandom.com/wiki/Swampjaw","https://ftb.fandom.com/wiki/Fossil_Bait"],"drops_note":"pack override loot table (kubejs/data)"},"Draugr → Night Shade":{"entity":["soulsweapons:draugr_boss","soulsweapons:night_shade"],"mod":"Marium's Soulslike Weaponry","find":"Old Champion's Remains sleeps in the Old Champion's Graves (find with a Moonstone Compass). When it dies the Frenzied Shade comes out; that second phase is the real kill. Re-fight by using the Draugr sword on an Old Moon Altar.","drops":[{"id":"soulsweapons:draugr","n":"Draugr","chance":"100%"},{"id":"soulsweapons:lord_soul_dark","n":"Lord Soul","chance":"100%"},{"id":"soulsweapons:essence_of_eventide","n":"Essence of Eventide","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Shield stance","desc":"Guards behind his shield, bashes and vaults at you; same-weapon spam makes him resist."},{"name":"Heavy Blow","desc":"Winds back and slams the sword down in an area."},{"name":"Battle Cry","desc":"Bangs sword on shield to slow and weaken everyone near."},{"name":"Shade: Moon Wave","desc":"The Shade throws a big moonlight wave."},{"name":"Shade: Soul Outbreak","desc":"Flies up and crashes down in a soul explosion; splits into copies at half health."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"render","sources":["https://github.com/mariumbacchus/Soulslike-Weaponry/wiki/Bosses"]},"Bellringer":{"entity":"meetyourfight:bellringer","mod":"Meet Your Fight","find":"Summoned with a Haunted Bell (gold and cobbled deepslate). Floats through walls.","drops":[{"id":"meetyourfight:phantoplasm","n":"Phantoplasm","chance":"100%"},{"id":"minecraft:gold_ingot","n":"Gold Ingot","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Projectile lines","desc":"Sends waves of projectiles along the ground toward you; they pass through walls."},{"name":"Falling square","desc":"Forms a square of projectiles above you that drops down."},{"name":"Bell toll","desc":"Below half health rings its bell to slow everyone, then fires a long barrage."}],"img_src":null,"sources":["https://ftb.fandom.com/wiki/Bellringer"],"drops_note":"pack override loot table (kubejs/data)"},"Frostbitten Golem":{"entity":"legendary_monsters:frostbitten_golem","mod":"Legendary Monsters","find":"Sleeps in the Frostbitten Temple in snowy plains, snowy taiga and ice spikes. Craft its locator eye to find it.","drops":[{"id":"legendary_monsters:frozen_rune","n":"Frozen Rune","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Freezing hits","desc":"Its punches freeze and slow you."},{"name":"Ice spikes","desc":"Raises ice spikes out of the ground under you."}],"img_src":null,"sources":["https://www.minecraft-guides.com/mod/legendary-monsters/","https://modrinth.com/mod/legendary-monsters"]},"Dune Sentinel":{"entity":"legendary_monsters:dune_sentinel","mod":"Legendary Monsters","find":"Buried in the Ruined Pyramid in deserts. Craft its locator eye to find it.","drops":[{"id":"legendary_monsters:crystal_of_sandstorm","n":"Crystal Of Sandstorm","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Sandstone shots","desc":"A living sandstone cannon that keeps you away with ranged shots."},{"name":"Immovable","desc":"Cannot be knocked back at all."}],"img_src":null,"sources":["https://www.minecraft-guides.com/mod/legendary-monsters/"]},"Overgrown Colossus":{"entity":"legendary_monsters:overgrown_colossus","mod":"Legendary Monsters","find":"Hidden in the Mossy Temple in jungles. Craft its locator eye to find it.","drops":[{"id":"legendary_monsters:nature_crystal","n":"Nature Crystal","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Poison blows","desc":"Heavy hits that poison you if you stay in melee."},{"name":"Mossy Golems","desc":"Calls Mossy Golems to help at half and quarter health."}],"img_src":null,"sources":["https://modrinth.com/mod/legendary-monsters","https://www.minecraft-guides.com/mod/legendary-monsters/"]},"Skeletosaurus":{"entity":"legendary_monsters:skeletosaurus","mod":"Legendary Monsters","find":"Sleeps in a Skeletosaurus Nest in Nether soul sand valleys. Throw an Eye of Bones to find one.","drops":[{"id":"legendary_monsters:dinosaur_bone","n":"Dinosaur Bone","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Tail whip","desc":"Sweeps its tail to launch you; becomes a double whip below half health."},{"name":"Ground slam","desc":"Shakes the ground with a shockwave."},{"name":"Roar","desc":"A scary roar that throws you off balance."},{"name":"Gravity pull","desc":"Later in the fight it pulls you in and can lift you up."}],"img_src":null,"sources":["https://www.minecraft-guides.com/mod/legendary-monsters/wiki/skeletosaurus","https://modrinth.com/mod/legendary-monsters"]},"Yeti":{"entity":"block_factorys_bosses:yeti","mod":"Bosses'Rise","find":"Skor the Yeti waits in its arena in frozen plains (Bosses'Rise).","drops":[{"id":"block_factorys_bosses:frozen_fist","n":"Frozen Fist","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Fist swing","desc":"Wide two-fist swing that freezes you."},{"name":"Leap slam","desc":"Jumps high and crashes down; icicles burst from the ground."},{"name":"Ice chunks","desc":"After half health throws fast chunks of ice."},{"name":"Ice Barrage","desc":"Its big finishing attack."}],"img_src":null,"sources":["https://www.minecraft-guides.com/mod/bossesrise/","https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bossesrise/files/7646024"]},"Frostmaw":{"entity":"mowziesmobs:frostmaw","mod":"Mowzie's Mobs","find":"Sleeps rarely in snowy plains and ice spikes, holding an Ice Crystal. Steal the crystal first to make the fight easier.","drops":[{"id":"mowziesmobs:ice_crystal","n":"Ice Crystal","chance":"100%"},{"id":"mowziesmobs:music_disc_petiole","n":"Music Disc","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Swipe","desc":"Swipes in front, sometimes twice; can disable shields."},{"name":"Ice breath","desc":"Breathes a freezing whirlwind (not if you stole its crystal)."},{"name":"Ice ball","desc":"Shoots a freezing ball when you are far away."},{"name":"Slam","desc":"Below about 60% health stands up and slams the ground; breaks shields."},{"name":"Roar","desc":"Knocks everyone near away."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mowziesmobs/images/9/95/260px-Entity_MOWM_Frostmaw.png/revision/latest?cb=20240306201630","sources":["https://mowziesmobs.fandom.com/wiki/Frostmaws"]},"Umvuthi":{"entity":"mowziesmobs:umvuthi","mod":"Mowzie's Mobs","find":"Sits on his throne in the Umvuthana Grove in savannas. Wearing an Umvuthana mask keeps him calm.","drops":[{"id":"mowziesmobs:sol_visage","n":"Sol Visage","chance":"100%"},{"id":"minecraft:feather","n":"Feather","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Sunstrike","desc":"Calls a beam of sunfire down where you are going."},{"name":"Solar Flare","desc":"Blasts away anyone close to him."},{"name":"Solar Beam","desc":"Later fires a long tracking sun beam."},{"name":"Supernova","desc":"Pulls you in, then explodes in fire."},{"name":"Cranes and followers","desc":"Summons followers; Cranes heal and shield him until killed."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"render","sources":["https://mowziesmobs.fandom.com/wiki/Umvuthi,_the_Sunbird"]},"Naga":{"entity":"mowziesmobs:naga","mod":"Mowzie's Mobs","find":"Flies in packs over stony shores. Not a boss bar fight, but tough in groups.","drops":[{"id":"mowziesmobs:naga_fang","n":"Naga Fang","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Acid spit","desc":"Spits acid balls that poison."},{"name":"Swoop","desc":"Dives and spins into you."},{"name":"Dodge","desc":"Dodges arrows; a hit while it attacks knocks it down."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mowziesmobs/images/a/a5/Naga_New.webp/revision/latest?cb=20240827140424","sources":["https://mowziesmobs.fandom.com/wiki/Naga"]},"Dame Fortuna":{"entity":"meetyourfight:dame_fortuna","mod":"Meet Your Fight","find":"Summoned with a Devil's Ante (gold, netherrack and a diamond).","drops":[{"id":"meetyourfight:fortunes_favor","n":"Fortune's Favor","chance":"100%"},{"id":"minecraft:emerald","n":"Emerald","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Card shots","desc":"Throws projectiles straight at you."},{"name":"Rain from above","desc":"Sends the same projectiles down from above."},{"name":"Chasing fangs","desc":"Fangs rise from the ground following you."}],"img_src":null,"sources":["https://ftb.fandom.com/wiki/Devil%27s_Ante","https://prodigium-reforged.fandom.com/wiki/Dame_Fortuna"],"drops_note":"pack override loot table (kubejs/data)"},"Dead King":{"entity":"irons_spellbooks:dead_king","mod":"Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks","find":"Sits on a throne at the end of the Catacombs deep underground (find with a Wayward Compass). Walk up to wake him.","drops":[{"id":"irons_spellbooks:blood_staff","n":"The Blood Staff","chance":"25%"},{"id":"irons_spellbooks:necronomicon_spell_book","n":"Necronomicon","chance":"25%"},{"id":"irons_spellbooks:arcane_essence","n":"Arcane Essence","chance":"100%"},{"id":"irons_spellbooks:scroll","n":"Scroll","chance":"75%"},{"id":"irons_spellbooks:blank_rune","n":"Blank Runestone","chance":"75%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Double swing and slam","desc":"Two quick hits or a heavy slam with a wind-up."},{"name":"Wither skulls","desc":"Fires volleys of wither skulls."},{"name":"Raise Dead","desc":"Summons undead minions from the floor."},{"name":"Vex and Blaze Storm","desc":"In the last phase he flies and adds vexes and fire storms."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"render","sources":["https://www.minecraft-guides.com/mod-guides/dead-king-irons-spells-and-spellbooks","https://iron.wiki/structures"]},"Cumulonimbus":{"entity":"legendary_monsters:cloud_golem","mod":"Legendary Monsters","find":"Cumulonimbus lives in the Cloudy Temple. Craft its locator eye to find it.","drops":[{"id":"legendary_monsters:air_rune","n":"Air Rune","chance":"100%"},{"id":"legendary_monsters:atmospheric_boots","n":"Atmospheric Boots","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Exploding clouds","desc":"Summons big clouds above you that explode."},{"name":"Block hit","desc":"A blocking hit that puts your shield on cooldown."},{"name":"Angry phase","desc":"In phase two fights with both arms and calls lightning."}],"img_src":null,"sources":["https://modrinth.com/mod/legendary-monsters","https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/legendary-monsters/files/6247667"]},"Ancient Guardian":{"entity":"legendary_monsters:ancient_guardian","mod":"Legendary Monsters","find":"Sleeps in the Ancient Stronghold in dark forest and taiga (Eye of Many Ribs). Projectiles do not hurt it.","drops":[{"id":"legendary_monsters:anchor_handle","n":"Anchor Handle","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Anchor combo","desc":"Three wide anchor swings; the last knocks your shield away."},{"name":"Stun slam","desc":"Warned on screen; stuns you unless you block."},{"name":"Grab","desc":"Grabs you if you are not blocking and pounds you into the ground."},{"name":"Leap","desc":"Jumps at you from range."}],"img_src":null,"sources":["https://www.minecraft-guides.com/mod/legendary-monsters/wiki/ancient-guardian/"]},"Netherite Monstrosity":{"entity":"cataclysm:netherite_monstrosity","mod":"L_Ender's Cataclysm","find":"Sleeps in the soul fire of the Soul Forge in the Nether; wakes when you come close.","drops":[{"id":"cataclysm:infernal_forge","n":"Infernal Forge","chance":"100%"},{"id":"cataclysm:monstrous_horn","n":"Monstrous Horn","chance":"100%"},{"id":"cataclysm:lava_power_cell","n":"Lava Power Cell","chance":"100%"},{"id":"cataclysm:music_disc_netherite_monstrosity","n":"Music Disc","chance":"10%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Slam","desc":"Slams both fists for a big area hit."},{"name":"Lava spit","desc":"Spits magma bombs that leave lava."},{"name":"Charged arm","desc":"Charges at you, breaking blocks and slowing you."},{"name":"Earth wave","desc":"Throws the ground at you; shields can block it."},{"name":"Lava heal","desc":"Sucks up lava to heal; enrages near the end and sets you on fire."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"https://lendercataclysm.wiki.gg/images/Netherite_Monstrosity.png","sources":["https://lendercataclysm.wiki.gg/wiki/Netherite_Monstrosity"]},"Rosalyne":{"entity":"meetyourfight:rosalyne","mod":"Meet Your Fight","find":"Summoned with a Dusk Key (blackstone, amethyst, a diamond and an allium).","drops":[{"id":"meetyourfight:violet_bloom","n":"Violet Bloom","chance":"100%"},{"id":"minecraft:book","n":"Enchanted Book","chance":"84%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Rose Spirits","desc":"Starts sealed in stone with four Rose Spirits; kill them to break her shell. Happens again at half health."},{"name":"Charging slashes","desc":"Rises, then charges and swings her sword at you."},{"name":"Frenzy","desc":"In the last phase swings many more times with short pauses."}],"img_src":null,"sources":["https://ftb.fandom.com/wiki/Rosalyne,_Blade_of_Dusk"],"drops_note":"pack override loot table (kubejs/data)"},"Luxtructosaurus":{"entity":"alexscaves:luxtructosaurus","mod":"Alex's Caves","find":"Sealed inside a volcano in the Primordial Caves. Throw an Ominous Catalyst into the top of the volcano to wake it.","drops":[{"id":"alexscaves:tectonic_shard","n":"Tectonic Shard","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Stomp","desc":"Opens magma-filled cracks under you."},{"name":"Tail whip","desc":"A flaming tail sweep that sets you on fire."},{"name":"Roar","desc":"Rains tephra rocks from the sky."},{"name":"Leap","desc":"Jumps great distances or smashes through blocks to reach you."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"https://alexscaves.wiki.gg/images/Luxtructosaurus.webp","sources":["https://alexscaves.wiki.gg/wiki/Luxtructosaurus"]},"Forsaken":{"entity":"alexscaves:forsaken","mod":"Alex's Caves","find":"Created in the Forlorn Hollows when Underzealots perform a ritual on a Vesper.","drops":[{"id":"alexscaves:pure_darkness","n":"Pure Darkness","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Bite","desc":"Grabs and bites you up close."},{"name":"Ground smash","desc":"Slams its arms down and launches you."},{"name":"Slash","desc":"Swipes with an upper arm and knocks you aside."},{"name":"Sonic blast","desc":"Howls and fires sonic waves into the ground."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"https://alexscaves.wiki.gg/images/Forsaken.webp","sources":["https://alexscaves.wiki.gg/wiki/Forsaken"]},"Returning Knight":{"entity":"soulsweapons:returning_knight","mod":"Marium's Soulslike Weaponry","find":"Use a Lost Soul on an Old Moon Altar. Using an Essence of Eventide instead summons the harder Fallen Icon (Moonknight).","drops":[{"id":"soulsweapons:nightfall","n":"Nightfall","chance":"100%"},{"id":"soulsweapons:lord_soul_rose","n":"Lord Soul","chance":"100%"},{"id":"soulsweapons:arkenstone","n":"Arkenstone","chance":"100%"},{"id":"soulsweapons:soul_ingot","n":"Soul Infused Ingot","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Obliterate","desc":"Charges his mace, then smashes your old spot; very slow but huge."},{"name":"Mace of Spades","desc":"A wide swipe followed by a quicker slam."},{"name":"Blinding Light","desc":"Arm sweep that blinds and slows you."},{"name":"Eruption","desc":"Slams three times; the third erupts the ground around him."},{"name":"Children of the Grave","desc":"Summons Remnants and Dark Sorcerers; reflects all projectiles."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"render","sources":["https://github.com/mariumbacchus/Soulslike-Weaponry/wiki/Bosses"]},"Vizier":{"entity":"goety:vizier","mod":"Goety","find":"Use a Dark Scroll (black dye, magic fabric, totem of undying) inside a woodland mansion.","drops":[{"id":"goety:treasure_pouch","n":"Treasure Pouch","chance":"100%"},{"id":"goety:music_disc_vizier","n":"Music Disc","chance":"25%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Sword lunge","desc":"Flies through walls and lunges at you like a vex."},{"name":"Fang rain","desc":"Floats over you and summons evoker fangs at your feet."},{"name":"Royal spikes","desc":"Sends a row of spikes, or swords if you are in the air."},{"name":"Irks and visages","desc":"Spawns Irks when hurt and heals from them; summons two invincible visages at half health."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"https://goety.wiki.gg/images/Vizier.png","sources":["https://goety.wiki.gg/wiki/Vizier"]},"Malkuth":{"entity":"fdbosses:malkuth","mod":"Qliphoth Awakening","find":"Find his arena with an Eye of Malkuth, then right-click the boss spawner there to read his moves and summon him.","drops":[{"id":"fdbosses:fire_and_ice_core","n":"Fire and Ice Core","chance":"100%"},{"id":"fdbosses:malkuth_fist","n":"Emberfrost Gauntlet","chance":"100%"},{"id":"fdbosses:malkuth_trophy","n":"Malkuth Trophy","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Fire and Ice","desc":"His attacks switch between fire and ice; you get weak to one type."},{"name":"Cannonade","desc":"Jumps on the wall and fires cannons; you can fire your own cannons back."},{"name":"Earthshatter and Chainpunch","desc":"Leaps and crushes the ground, then punches anyone thrown in the air."},{"name":"Impaling Doom","desc":"Sends lines of fire or ice spikes."},{"name":"Tsar's Wrath","desc":"Summons two giant swords that slam down."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"render","sources":["https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/qliphoth-awakening","jar: fdbosses in-game boss skill descriptions (assets/fdbosses/lang/en_us.json)"]},"Corpse Warlock":{"entity":"eeeabsmobs:corpse_warlock","mod":"EEEAB's Mobs","find":"Rules the Bloody Altar in the Nether.","drops":[{"id":"eeeabsmobs:heart_of_pagan","n":"Heart of Pagan","chance":"always (drop is in code, per guide)"},{"id":"eeeabsmobs:soul_summon_necklace","n":"Summoning Soul Necklace","chance":"always (drop is in code, per guide)"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Corpse waves","desc":"Summons corpses in waves and buffs them with Frenzy."},{"name":"Vampire","desc":"Drains his corpses to heal; kill them first."},{"name":"Tear Space","desc":"Places spike traps on the ground in your path."},{"name":"Crimson Rays","desc":"Rains crimson rays down; teleports away when you get close."}],"img_src":null,"sources":["https://www.minecraft-guides.com/mod/eeeabs-mobs"]},"Lich":{"entity":"bosses_of_mass_destruction:lich","mod":"Bosses of Mass Destruction","find":"The Night Lich is summoned in the Lich Tower in cold biomes by putting a Soul Star in each of four altars. Soul Stars drop from zombies and skeletons and point to the tower.","drops":[{"id":"bosses_of_mass_destruction:ancient_anima","n":"Ancient Anima","chance":"100%"},{"id":"minecraft:diamond","n":"Diamond","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Exploding orb","desc":"Launches orbs that hit hard and break terrain."},{"name":"Phantoms","desc":"Summons phantoms to attack you."},{"name":"Slowing magic","desc":"Can slow you; flies out of melee range, so bring a bow."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"render","sources":["https://www.minecraft-guides.com/wiki/bosses-of-mass-destruction/night-lich","https://modrinth.com/mod/bosses-of-mass-destruction"]},"Underworld Knight":{"entity":"block_factorys_bosses:underworld_knight","mod":"Bosses'Rise","find":"Helvar waits in the Underworld Arena in the Nether; the boss door needs a key found in that dungeon.","drops":[{"id":"block_factorys_bosses:knight_sword","n":"Knight Sword","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Dash thrust","desc":"Dashes across the arena to impale you."},{"name":"Combo slashes","desc":"Fast sword combos while moving forward."},{"name":"Aerial slam","desc":"Leaps up and slams down, cracking the floor."},{"name":"Vulnerable marks","desc":"Hit his marks to knock him down for free damage."}],"img_src":null,"sources":["https://www.minecraft-guides.com/mod/bossesrise/","https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bossesrise/files/7646024"]},"Super Sniffer":{"entity":"terramity:super_sniffer","mod":"Terramity","find":"Strike any Sniffer with lightning (a Lightning Staff works) and it turns into the Super Sniffer.","drops":[{"id":"terramity:accursed_soul","n":"Accursed Soul","chance":"100%"},{"id":"terramity:gaianite_cluster","n":"Gaianite Cluster","chance":"100%"},{"id":"terramity:evil_king_armor_helmet","n":"Evil King's Hat","chance":"25%"},{"id":"terramity:evil_king_armor_chestplate","n":"Evil King's Gi","chance":"25%"},{"id":"terramity:evil_king_armor_leggings","n":"Evil King's Leggings","chance":"25%"},{"id":"terramity:evil_king_armor_boots","n":"Evil King's Boots","chance":"25%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Uppercut","desc":"Swings its fist up and throws you very high."},{"name":"Slam","desc":"Slams the ground, sometimes after teleporting into the air."},{"name":"Energy beam","desc":"In phase two fires a long beam that follows you."},{"name":"Guided Energy Blast","desc":"Below half health fires a huge blast that wrecks the ground."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"render","sources":["https://terramity.wiki.gg/wiki/Super_Sniffer"]},"Gundalf, Circe, Merlin (Shadow Wizards)":{"entity":["terramity:gundalf","terramity:sorceress_circe","terramity:enchanter_merlin"],"mod":"Terramity","find":"Use an Occult Fabric on the offering pedestal in the middle of a Chthonic Cathedral on the Nether roof. Kill Merlin and Circe close together and they merge into Archmage Gundalf.","drops":[{"id":"terramity:antiprism","n":"Antiprism","chance":"100%"},{"id":"terramity:occult_fabric","n":"Occult Fabric","chance":"100%"},{"id":"terramity:chthonic_shell_casing","n":"Chthonic Shell Casing","chance":"40%"},{"id":"terramity:malediction_bracelets","n":"Malediction Bracelets","chance":"40%"},{"id":"terramity:gundalfs_hat_helmet","n":"Gundalf's Pointed Hat","chance":"20%"},{"id":"terramity:fortunes_favor","n":"Fortune's Favor","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"render","sources":["https://terramity.wiki.gg/wiki/Shadow_Wizards"]},"Forgotten Guardian":{"entity":"undergarden:forgotten_guardian","mod":"The Undergarden","find":"Stands in the Catacombs of the Undergarden (in Frostfields and Forgotten Fields). Several can be in one dungeon.","drops":[{"id":"undergarden:forgotten_nugget","n":"Forgotten Nugget","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Slow chase","desc":"Stands still until you come near, then follows you."},{"name":"Heavy melee","desc":"Hits hard up close and deflects some attacks."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/the-undergarden-mod/images/5/51/Forgotten_Guardian.png/revision/latest?cb=20210601171559","sources":["https://the-undergarden-mod.fandom.com/wiki/Forgotten_Guardian"]},"Ender Guardian":{"entity":"cataclysm:ender_guardian","mod":"L_Ender's Cataclysm","find":"Spawns when you approach the Altar of Void on the third floor of the Ruined Citadel in the End.","drops":[{"id":"cataclysm:gauntlet_of_guard","n":"Gauntlet of Guard","chance":"100%"},{"id":"cataclysm:music_disc_ender_guardian","n":"Music Disc","chance":"10%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Void runes","desc":"Summons void runes under you."},{"name":"Shulker bullets","desc":"Fires bullets that make you float."},{"name":"Ender tornado","desc":"Creates a tornado that traps you and explodes."},{"name":"Ground slam","desc":"After losing its helmet at half health, breaks the floor around it."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"https://lendercataclysm.wiki.gg/images/Ender_Guardian.png","sources":["https://lendercataclysm.wiki.gg/wiki/Ender_Guardian"]},"Ancient Remnant":{"entity":"cataclysm:ancient_remnant","mod":"L_Ender's Cataclysm","find":"At the bottom of the Cursed Pyramid in deserts; beat its guards first to wake it.","drops":[{"id":"cataclysm:sandstorm_in_a_bottle","n":"Sandstorm in a Bottle","chance":"100%"},{"id":"cataclysm:remnant_skull","n":"Remnant's Skull","chance":"100%"},{"id":"cataclysm:ancient_metal_block","n":"Block of Ancient Metal","chance":"100%"},{"id":"cataclysm:music_disc_ancient_remnant","n":"Music Disc","chance":"10%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Sand twisters","desc":"Roars and summons tornadoes that reverse your controls."},{"name":"Chomp","desc":"A heavy bite."},{"name":"Tail swipes","desc":"Sweeps its tail around."},{"name":"Tombstones","desc":"Drops tombstones on you like anvils."}],"img_src":null,"sources":["https://www.minecraft-guides.com/wiki/cataclysm/cursed-pyramid/ancient-remnant","https://mcmobs.fandom.com/wiki/Ancient_Remnant"]},"Gauntlet":{"entity":"bosses_of_mass_destruction:gauntlet","mod":"Bosses of Mass Destruction","find":"The Nether Gauntlet hides in a rare Gauntlet Arena in the Nether. Break one of the eye blocks on the central pillar with a pickaxe to summon it. Its loot is in a chest after the fight.","drops":[{"id":"bosses_of_mass_destruction:blazing_eye","n":"Blazing Eye","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Fist charge","desc":"Turns into a fist and rams you; an empowered version explodes and leaves fire."},{"name":"Red laser","desc":"Charges up and fires a laser that chases you."},{"name":"Eye window","desc":"Only takes damage while its eye is open, usually after an attack."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"render","sources":["https://www.minecraft-guides.com/wiki/bosses-of-mass-destruction/nether-gauntlet"]},"Obsidilith":{"entity":"bosses_of_mass_destruction:obsidilith","mod":"Bosses of Mass Destruction","find":"Put an Eye of Ender into the Obsidian Altar on the roof of the Obsidilith Arena floating in the End. An Elytra helps. Its loot is in a chest after the fight.","drops":[{"id":"bosses_of_mass_destruction:obsidian_heart","n":"Obsidian Heart","chance":"100%"},{"id":"minecraft:purpur_block","n":"Purpur Block","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Teleport blasts","desc":"Teleports around the arena and deals big explosive damage."},{"name":"Rune blocks","desc":"Summons runic blocks that empower it."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"render","sources":["https://www.minecraft-guides.com/mod/bosses-of-mass-destruction/"]},"Void Blossom":{"entity":"bosses_of_mass_destruction:void_blossom","mod":"Bosses of Mass Destruction","find":"Grows in a rare lush cave near the bottom of the Overworld; Void Lilies point the way. The fight starts when you enter.","drops":[{"id":"bosses_of_mass_destruction:void_thorn","n":"Void Thorn","chance":"100%"},{"id":"bosses_of_mass_destruction:crystal_fruit","n":"Crystal Fruit","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Thorns","desc":"Spikes rise under your feet or burst outward in a ring."},{"name":"Spore bomb","desc":"Fires a green spore that explodes and poisons you."},{"name":"Healing petals","desc":"Places small blossoms that heal it until you break them."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"render","sources":["https://www.minecraft-guides.com/wiki/bosses-of-mass-destruction/void-blossom"]},"Chesed":{"entity":"fdbosses:chesed","mod":"Qliphoth Awakening","find":"Find his arena with an Eye of Chesed, then right-click the boss spawner to read his moves and summon him.","drops":[{"id":"fdbosses:lightning_core","n":"Lightning Core","chance":"100%"},{"id":"fdbosses:phase_sphere","n":"Phase Sphere","chance":"100%"},{"id":"fdbosses:chesed_trophy","n":"Chesed Trophy","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Block Barrage","desc":"Tears blocks out of the ground and throws them."},{"name":"Earthquake","desc":"Slams the floor, sending a shockwave and lightning."},{"name":"Rolling Thunder","desc":"Rolls around the arena; leaves fire in phase two."},{"name":"Lightning Ray","desc":"Fires huge rays; break a crystal to become immune."},{"name":"Tenebrae Aeternae","desc":"Drains his monoliths for a strike that hits everyone."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"render","sources":["https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/qliphoth-awakening","jar: fdbosses in-game boss skill descriptions (assets/fdbosses/lang/en_us.json)"]},"Moonknight":{"entity":["soulsweapons:moonknight","soulsweapons:moonknight_phase_2"],"mod":"Marium's Soulslike Weaponry","find":"The Fallen Icon: use an Essence of Eventide (from the Frenzied Shade) on an Old Moon Altar. At half health it becomes the Harbinger of Moonlight.","drops":[{"id":"soulsweapons:moonlight_greatsword","n":"Moonlight Greatsword","chance":"100%"},{"id":"soulsweapons:lord_soul_white","n":"Lord Soul","chance":"100%"},{"id":"soulsweapons:essence_of_luminescence","n":"Essence of Luminescence","chance":"100%"},{"id":"soulsweapons:moonstone","n":"Moonstone","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Unbreakable","desc":"On spawn weakens, slows and nauseates players near it."},{"name":"Obliterate","desc":"A slightly faster version of the knight's mace slam."},{"name":"Moonfall","desc":"Slams the greatsword down, cracking the ground behind you."},{"name":"Sword of Light","desc":"Five swings that each shoot a moonlight wave."},{"name":"Core Beam","desc":"Fires a big beam that sets off explosions."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"render","sources":["https://github.com/mariumbacchus/Soulslike-Weaponry/wiki/Bosses"]},"Accursed Lord":{"entity":"soulsweapons:accursed_lord_boss","mod":"Marium's Soulslike Weaponry","find":"The Decaying King lives in the throne room of the Decaying Kingdom in the Nether. Re-fight with a Withered Demon Heart on a Blackstone Pedestal.","drops":[{"id":"soulsweapons:lord_soul_red","n":"Lord Soul","chance":"100%"},{"id":"soulsweapons:darkin_blade","n":"The Darkin Blade","chance":"100%"},{"id":"soulsweapons:withered_demon_heart","n":"Withered Demon Heart","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Sword Slam","desc":"Slams his blade where you stood."},{"name":"Fire and Wither Barrage","desc":"Spits fireballs or shadow orbs."},{"name":"Detonation","desc":"Charges an explosion around himself."},{"name":"Pull and Spin","desc":"Pulls you in, or spins to knock you far, maybe into lava."},{"name":"Magma Burst","desc":"Floods the ground around him with lava."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"render","sources":["https://github.com/mariumbacchus/Soulslike-Weaponry/wiki/Bosses"]},"Tyros (fire boss)":{"entity":"irons_spellbooks:fire_boss","mod":"Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks","find":"Echo of Tyros: use a Cinderous Soulcaller (cinder essence, netherite scrap, echo shard) at the Cinderous Soul Rune in the Citadel in the Nether.","drops":[{"id":"irons_spellbooks:divine_soulshard","n":"Divine Soulshard","chance":"100%"},{"id":"irons_spellbooks:decrepit_scythe","n":"Decrepit Scythe","chance":"28%"},{"id":"irons_spellbooks:betrayer_signet","n":"Signet of the Betrayer","chance":"28%"},{"id":"irons_spellbooks:cinder_essence","n":"Cinder Essence","chance":"100%"},{"id":"irons_spellbooks:arcane_essence","n":"Arcane Essence","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Melee combos","desc":"Five different fiery sword combos."},{"name":"Fire spells","desc":"Casts fire magic; your own fire spells do less to him."},{"name":"Citadel Keepers","desc":"Summons Citadel Keepers to fight with him."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"render","sources":["https://www.minecraft-guides.com/mod/irons-spells-and-spellbooks/wiki/cinderous-soulcaller","https://iron.wiki/changelog/"]},"Infernal Dragon":{"entity":"block_factorys_bosses:infernal_dragon","mod":"Bosses'Rise","find":"Ashlord waits on top of the Dragon Tower in plains and mountains; climb past its guards.","drops":[{"id":"block_factorys_bosses:dragon_bone","n":"Dragon Bone","chance":"100%"},{"id":"block_factorys_bosses:dragon_skull","n":"Dragon Skull","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Fire breath","desc":"Breathes fire that leaves burning ground."},{"name":"Stomp","desc":"Stomps with strong knockback, can push you off the tower."},{"name":"Tail sweep","desc":"Knocks you away."},{"name":"Bite","desc":"A fast bite with long reach."}],"img_src":null,"sources":["https://www.minecraft-guides.com/mod/bossesrise/"]},"Redstone Monstrosity":{"entity":"goety:redstone_monstrosity","mod":"Goety","find":"Goety's giant golem. A hostile one is a boss; players can also build one with a big mold and an Animation Core.","drops":[{"id":"minecraft:redstone_block","n":"Block of Redstone","chance":"100%"},{"id":"minecraft:cobblestone","n":"Cobblestone","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Smash","desc":"Smashes both fists into the ground for a big shockwave."},{"name":"Spit","desc":"Spits scatter bombs at you from range."},{"name":"Summon","desc":"Opens fissures that spawn redstone cubes."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"https://goety.wiki.gg/images/RM_Standing.gif","sources":["https://goety.wiki.gg/wiki/Redstone_Monstrosity"]},"Gob, King of Gnomes":{"entity":"terramity:gob","mod":"Terramity","find":"Use a Red Gnome Hat on the Golden Gnome Statue in a Court of Gnomes.","drops":[{"id":"terramity:gobs_gilded_hat_helmet","n":"Gob's Gilded Hat","chance":"33%"},{"id":"terramity:gobs_claymore","n":"Gob's Claymore","chance":"33%"},{"id":"terramity:belt_of_the_gnome_king","n":"Belt of the Gnome King","chance":"33%"},{"id":"terramity:iridescent_shard","n":"Iridescent Shard","chance":"42%"},{"id":"terramity:ruby","n":"Ruby","chance":"42%"},{"id":"terramity:sapphire","n":"Sapphire","chance":"42%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Spin slash","desc":"Spins with his sword in a circle."},{"name":"Ground punch","desc":"Punches the floor for a shockwave."},{"name":"Jump crush","desc":"Jumps to land on top of you."},{"name":"Soul fire slash","desc":"Throws a slash that sets you on fire."},{"name":"Fangs and gnomes","desc":"Summons evoker fangs and Royal Gnomes."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"render","sources":["https://terramity.wiki.gg/wiki/Gob,_King_of_Gnomes"]},"Trial Guardian":{"entity":"terramity:trial_guardian","mod":"Terramity","find":"Put a Spire Key into the padlock at the bottom of a Trial Spire. Leaving the arena despawns it.","drops":[{"id":"terramity:chthonic_cursemark","n":"Chthonic Cursemark","chance":"20%"},{"id":"terramity:guardians_hand","n":"Guardian's Hand","chance":"20%"},{"id":"terramity:giant_dungeon_slab","n":"Giant Dungeon Slab","chance":"20%"},{"id":"terramity:energized_core","n":"Energized Core","chance":"20%"},{"id":"terramity:guardian_grimoire","n":"Guardian Grimoire","chance":"20%"},{"id":"terramity:spiteful_soul","n":"Spiteful Soul","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Head explosion","desc":"Covers its head, then explodes around itself."},{"name":"Hex shot","desc":"Snaps its fingers to send a homing hex projectile."},{"name":"Spinning beams","desc":"Spins with beams shooting from both palms."},{"name":"Warp slam","desc":"Teleports above you and slams down."},{"name":"Dungeon Effigies","desc":"Summons helpers, more as its health drops."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"render","sources":["https://terramity.wiki.gg/wiki/Trial_Guardian"]},"Ignis":{"entity":"cataclysm:ignis","mod":"L_Ender's Cataclysm","find":"In the Burning Arena in the Nether (Eye of Flame). Beat the Ignited Revenants for Burning Ashes and put them on the Altar of Fire.","drops":[{"id":"cataclysm:ignitium_ingot","n":"Ignitium Ingot","chance":"100%"},{"id":"cataclysm:music_disc_ignis","n":"Music Disc","chance":"10%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Sword swings","desc":"Heavy swings that burn and melt armor."},{"name":"Shield smash","desc":"Rams or slams his shield, stunning you."},{"name":"Life steal skewer","desc":"A thrust that heals him."},{"name":"Fireballs and jumps","desc":"Leaps across the arena throwing fireballs."},{"name":"Floor breaking","desc":"Breaks the floor, dropping you into lava."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"https://lendercataclysm.wiki.gg/images/Ignis.png","sources":["https://lendercataclysm.wiki.gg/wiki/Ignis","https://www.minecraft-guides.com/wiki/cataclysm/burning-arena/ignis"]},"The Harbinger":{"entity":"cataclysm:the_harbinger","mod":"L_Ender's Cataclysm","find":"Sleeps in the Ancient Factory underground (Eye of Mech). Give it a Nether Star to wake it.","drops":[{"id":"cataclysm:witherite_block","n":"Block of Witherite","chance":"100%"},{"id":"cataclysm:music_disc_the_harbinger","n":"Music Disc","chance":"10%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Wither missiles","desc":"Fires missiles and arcing howitzer shells."},{"name":"Charge","desc":"Rockets forward, smashing through terrain."},{"name":"Death Laser","desc":"Sweeps the arena with a laser; hide behind walls."},{"name":"Half health","desc":"Becomes immune to arrows; EMP blocks stun it."}],"img_src":null,"sources":["https://www.minecraft-guides.com/mod/cataclysm/wiki/the-harbinger","https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lendercataclysm"]},"The Leviathan":{"entity":"cataclysm:the_leviathan","mod":"L_Ender's Cataclysm","find":"Put an Abyssal Sacrifice into the Altar of Abyss in the Sunken City (Eye of Abyss). It only takes damage in water.","drops":[{"id":"cataclysm:tidal_claws","n":"Tidal Claws","chance":"100%"},{"id":"cataclysm:abyssal_egg","n":"Abyssal Egg","chance":"100%"},{"id":"cataclysm:music_disc_the_leviathan","n":"Music Disc","chance":"10%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Tentacle smack","desc":"Whips a tentacle at you."},{"name":"Masticate","desc":"A brutal bite that stuns."},{"name":"Tongue pull","desc":"Grabs you with its tongue and drags you in."},{"name":"Dimensional Tear","desc":"Opens a black hole that pulls you and explodes."},{"name":"Lasers","desc":"Fires beams and portals around the arena."}],"img_src":null,"sources":["https://www.minecraft-guides.com/wiki/cataclysm/sunken-city/leviathan","https://lendercataclysm.wiki.gg/wiki/The_Leviathan"]},"Geburah":{"entity":"fdbosses:geburah","mod":"Qliphoth Awakening","find":"Find its arena with an Eye of Geburah, then right-click the boss spawner to read its moves and summon it.","drops":[{"id":"fdbosses:justice_core","n":"Justice Core","chance":"100%"},{"id":"fdbosses:divine_gear","n":"Divine Gear","chance":"100%"},{"id":"fdbosses:geburah_trophy","n":"Geburah Trophy","chance":"100%"},{"id":"fdbosses:polished_justicestone","n":"Polished Justicestone","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Ray of Purification","desc":"Charges and fires a huge ray from its core."},{"name":"Rays of Justice","desc":"Rotates constant lasers around the arena."},{"name":"Earthquake","desc":"Stomps to send a shockwave."},{"name":"Sins","desc":"Bans an action (jumping, standing still, killing...); breaking the rule builds up sin."},{"name":"Divine Judgement","desc":"Balance the scales by hitting bells or take a huge hit."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"render","sources":["https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/qliphoth-awakening","jar: fdbosses in-game boss skill descriptions (assets/fdbosses/lang/en_us.json)"]},"Nameless Guardian":{"entity":"eeeabsmobs:nameless_guardian","mod":"EEEAB's Mobs","find":"Since EEEAB's Mobs 0.98 it no longer spawns in normal survival (only eggs or commands). It used to guard the Coreforge Ruins.","drops":[],"attacks":[{"name":"Shield breaker","desc":"Melee hits that stop you using a shield."},{"name":"Life drain","desc":"All its attacks heal it."},{"name":"Powered state","desc":"Below 60% health it hits harder and ignores projectiles."},{"name":"Core weak point","desc":"Only the glowing core inside the body takes real damage."}],"img_src":null,"sources":["https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eeeabs-mobs","https://metamods.net/en/mods/eeeab-s-mobs","https://www.minecraft-guides.com/mod/eeeabs-mobs"]},"Realm Warden":{"entity":"eeeabsmobs:realm_warden","mod":"EEEAB's Mobs","find":"The Realmwarden guards the portal in the Coreforge Ruins underground (Eye of Coreforge Ruins).","drops":[{"id":"eeeabsmobs:boundary_brick","n":"Boundary Brick","chance":"100%"},{"id":"eeeabsmobs:ancient_drive_crystal","n":"Ancient Drive Crystal","chance":"100%"},{"id":"eeeabsmobs:guardian_cube","n":"Guardian Core","chance":"100%"},{"id":"eeeabsmobs:relicron_upgrade_smithing_template","n":"Relicron Upgrade Smithing Template","chance":"2%"},{"id":"eeeabsmobs:realm_warden_theme_music_disc","n":"Music Disc","chance":"50%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Ground pound","desc":"Big area hit in the middle of the room; hug the walls."},{"name":"Swings and sweeps","desc":"Heavy swings, elbows, stomps and wide sweeps."},{"name":"Backstep missiles","desc":"Jumps back while firing a missile volley."},{"name":"Overload","desc":"In phase two its hits make fire explode on you."}],"img_src":null,"sources":["https://www.minecraft-guides.com/mod/eeeabs-mobs"]},"Relic Annihilator":{"entity":"eeeabsmobs:relic_annihilator","mod":"EEEAB's Mobs","find":"A Relicron construct in the Coreforge Ruins underground (Eye of Coreforge Ruins).","drops":[{"id":"eeeabsmobs:boundary_brick","n":"Boundary Brick","chance":"100%"},{"id":"eeeabsmobs:ancient_drive_crystal","n":"Ancient Drive Crystal","chance":"100%"},{"id":"eeeabsmobs:chain_gear","n":"Chain Gear Core","chance":"100%"},{"id":"eeeabsmobs:relicron_upgrade_smithing_template","n":"Relicron Upgrade Smithing Template","chance":"2%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Missiles","desc":"Fires missiles at you."},{"name":"Saw blades","desc":"Spinning saw blades up close; very fast on its wheels."},{"name":"Exposed core","desc":"Its head core opens while firing missiles or lasers; hit it then."}],"img_src":null,"sources":["https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eeeabs-mobs","https://www.minecraft-guides.com/mod/eeeabs-mobs"]},"Day Stalker":{"entity":"soulsweapons:day_stalker","mod":"Marium's Soulslike Weaponry","find":"Throw a Chaos Orb into the sky to summon both Day Stalker and Night Prowler. The survivor enrages when one dies. She is stronger in daytime.","drops":[{"id":"soulsweapons:dawnbreaker","n":"Dawnbreaker","chance":"100%"},{"id":"soulsweapons:lord_soul_day_stalker","n":"Lord Soul","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Decimate","desc":"Drags Dawnbreaker along the ground and launches you up."},{"name":"Chaos Storm","desc":"Summons flame pillars around herself."},{"name":"Flamethrower","desc":"Sprays a stream of fire."},{"name":"Sunfire Rush","desc":"Five swings that shoot sunlight waves."},{"name":"Sky High","desc":"Flies high and crashes down in a huge explosion."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"render","sources":["https://github.com/mariumbacchus/Soulslike-Weaponry/wiki/Bosses"]},"Night Prowler":{"entity":"soulsweapons:night_prowler","mod":"Marium's Soulslike Weaponry","find":"Summoned together with the Day Stalker by throwing a Chaos Orb into the sky. She is stronger at night.","drops":[{"id":"soulsweapons:soul_reaper","n":"Soul Reaper","chance":"100%"},{"id":"soulsweapons:forlorn_scythe","n":"Scythe of the Forlorn","chance":"100%"},{"id":"soulsweapons:lord_soul_night_prowler","n":"Lord Soul","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Trinity","desc":"Hurls her scythe into the ground for an explosion."},{"name":"Ripple Fang","desc":"Rings of evoker fangs spread out from her."},{"name":"Blackflame Snake","desc":"Sends a homing snake of black fire."},{"name":"Darkness Rise","desc":"An aura that decays everyone near."},{"name":"Eclipse","desc":"Phase two ultimate that blasts everything around with dark skulls."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"render","sources":["https://github.com/mariumbacchus/Soulslike-Weaponry/wiki/Bosses"]},"The Obliterator":{"entity":"legendary_monsters:the_obliterator","mod":"Legendary Monsters","find":"Insert an Eye Crystal into the Teleport Machine in the Space Station in the End highlands, midlands or small islands.","drops":[{"id":"legendary_monsters:portal_shard","n":"Portal Shard","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Laser barrages","desc":"Fires four-beam laser barrages."},{"name":"Teleport combos","desc":"Teleports and chains attacks; bait a move, hit, then reset."}],"img_src":null,"sources":["https://www.minecraft-guides.com/mod/legendary-monsters/"]},"Apostle":{"entity":"goety:apostle","mod":"Goety","find":"Summoned by the Sabbath Ritual at a Goety dark altar (ritual in the Nether for the strongest drops).","drops":[{"id":"goety:treasure_pouch","n":"Treasure Pouch","chance":"100%"},{"id":"goety:music_disc_apostle","n":"Music Disc","chance":"25%"},{"id":"minecraft:blaze_rod","n":"Blaze Rod","chance":"70%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Arrows","desc":"Shoots arrows, faster as its health drops."},{"name":"Fireballs","desc":"Throws ghast-like fireballs (unblockable on hard)."},{"name":"Obsidian Monoliths","desc":"Summons monoliths that protect it and call servants."},{"name":"Second phase","desc":"Heals to full, brings a storm, meteors and lightning traps."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"https://goety.wiki.gg/images/Apostle.png","sources":["https://goety.wiki.gg/wiki/Apostle","https://prodigium-reforged.fandom.com/wiki/Apostle_(Goety)"]},"Ferrous Wroughtnaut":{"entity":"mowziesmobs:ferrous_wroughtnaut","mod":"Mowzie's Mobs","find":"Stands in the Wrought Chamber, an underground room found in almost every biome.","drops":[{"id":"mowziesmobs:wrought_helmet","n":"Wrought Helm","chance":"100%"},{"id":"mowziesmobs:wrought_axe","n":"Axe of a Thousand Metals","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Axe swing","desc":"Huge axe swing that breaks shields; chains into double and triple swings later."},{"name":"Overhead slam","desc":"Gets its axe stuck; the only time you can hit it, from behind."},{"name":"Stomp","desc":"Stomps to throw blocks up; jump to dodge."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mowziesmobs/images/f/fe/Ferrous_Wroughtnaut.png/revision/latest?cb=20220202231749","sources":["https://mowziesmobs.fandom.com/wiki/Ferrous_Wroughtnaut"]},"Maledictus":{"entity":"cataclysm:maledictus","mod":"L_Ender's Cataclysm","find":"Bottom chamber of the Frosted Prison in snowy biomes. Beat the Aptrgangr for the Strange Key, open the Door of Seal and right-click the Cursed Tombstone.","drops":[{"id":"cataclysm:cursium_ingot","n":"Cursium Ingot","chance":"100%"},{"id":"cataclysm:music_disc_maledictus","n":"Music Disc","chance":"10%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Colour warnings","desc":"Wrist rings show the attack: green can be blocked, orange breaks shields, red must be dodged."},{"name":"Rupturing Descent","desc":"Slam that sends shockwaves out."},{"name":"Warrior's Lunge","desc":"Halberd dash that hits many times."},{"name":"Thousand Pierced Fall","desc":"Rains spectral halberds over a wide area."},{"name":"Phantom Bow","desc":"Shoots you when you stay at range."}],"img_src":null,"sources":["https://www.minecraft-guides.com/wiki/cataclysm/frosted-prison/maledictus"]},"Scylla":{"entity":"cataclysm:scylla","mod":"L_Ender's Cataclysm","find":"At the top of the Acropolis in deep oceans (Eye of Storm). Right-click the giant anchor to summon her.","drops":[{"id":"cataclysm:lacrima","n":"Lacrima","chance":"100%"},{"id":"cataclysm:essence_of_the_storm","n":"Essence of the Storm","chance":"100%"},{"id":"cataclysm:music_disc_scylla","n":"Music Disc","chance":"10%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Anchor","desc":"Swings and throws her anchor to pull you in."},{"name":"Waves","desc":"Sends waves that make you Wet; wet players take more shock damage."},{"name":"Lightning spears","desc":"Throws lightning spears that ignore armor."},{"name":"Storm and serpents","desc":"Later summons storm spears and magic serpents."}],"img_src":null,"sources":["https://www.minecraft-guides.com/wiki/cataclysm/acropolis/scylla"]},"Immortal":{"entity":"eeeabsmobs:immortal","mod":"EEEAB's Mobs","find":" The quest book gives a summon command as its reward.","drops":[],"attacks":[{"name":"Damage adaptation","desc":"Adapts to damage types you repeat; switch types."},{"name":"Two phases","desc":"Has two health bars and resets adaptation between them."}],"img_src":null,"sources":["https://metamods.net/en/mods/eeeab-s-mobs","https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eeeabs-mobs"]},"Chaos Monarch":{"entity":"soulsweapons:chaos_monarch","mod":"Marium's Soulslike Weaponry","find":"Use a Shard of Uncertainty (dropped by the Wither) on a Blackstone Pedestal.","drops":[{"id":"soulsweapons:withered_wabbajack","n":"Withered Wabbajack","chance":"100%"},{"id":"soulsweapons:lord_soul_void","n":"Lord Soul","chance":"100%"},{"id":"soulsweapons:chaos_crown","n":"Crown of Chaos","chance":"100%"},{"id":"soulsweapons:chaos_robes","n":"Cape of Chaos","chance":"100%"},{"id":"soulsweapons:blood_vial_recipe_page","n":"Recipe Page","chance":"100%"},{"id":"minecraft:netherite_upgrade_smithing_template","n":"Netherite Upgrade Smithing Template","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Cripple","desc":"Staff combo of swipe, thrust and smash."},{"name":"Chaos Skulls","desc":"Skulls with random effects, explosions or mobs."},{"name":"Lightning Call","desc":"Lightning spreading outward three times."},{"name":"Barrage","desc":"Shoots piles of random projectiles."},{"name":"Withered ground","desc":"Turns grass to withered grass that decays you and heals it."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"render","sources":["https://github.com/mariumbacchus/Soulslike-Weaponry/wiki/Bosses"]},"The Nightwarden":{"entity":"traveloptics:the_nightwarden","mod":"T.O Magic 'n Extras","find":"Found only in the Void Cathedral, a rare structure in the End.","drops":[{"id":"irons_spellbooks:legendary_ink","n":"Legendary Ink","chance":"88%"},{"id":"traveloptics:withered_excrucis","n":"Withered Excrucis","chance":"100%"},{"id":"traveloptics:stellothorn","n":"Stellothorn","chance":"100%"},{"id":"traveloptics:cradle_of_will","n":"Cradle Of Will","chance":"50%"},{"id":"irons_spellbooks:arcane_essence","n":"Arcane Essence","chance":"100%"},{"id":"irons_spellbooks:scroll","n":"Scroll","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Many telegraphed attacks","desc":"Three phases with a dozen telegraphed spell and melee patterns."},{"name":"Damage adaptation","desc":"Resists damage you repeat; vary your attacks."},{"name":"Counterspell windows","desc":"Interrupting his casts gives openings."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"render","sources":["https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/to-tweaks-irons-spells"]},"Virtue":{"entity":"terramity:virtue","mod":"Terramity","find":"Throw an Unholy Lance into the sky anywhere in the Overworld. Stays very high in the air, so bring guns or bows.","drops":[{"id":"terramity:angel_feather","n":"Angel Feather","chance":"100%"},{"id":"terramity:archangel_halo","n":"Archangel Halo","chance":"10%"},{"id":"terramity:music_sheet_of_cleansing","n":"Music Sheet of Cleansing","chance":"33%"},{"id":"minecraft:gold_ingot","n":"Gold Ingot","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Light pillars","desc":"Creates pillars of light that hurt over time."},{"name":"Vulnerability","desc":"Its pillars make you take more damage."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"render","sources":["https://terramity.wiki.gg/wiki/Virtue"]},"Ultra Sniffer":{"entity":"terramity:ultra_sniffer","mod":"Terramity","find":"In the Super Sniffer's second phase, strike it with lightning again while it is under 10% health.","drops":[{"id":"terramity:black_matter","n":"Black Matter","chance":"99%"},{"id":"terramity:prismatic_jewel","n":"Prismatic Jewel","chance":"99%"},{"id":"terramity:antiprism","n":"Antiprism","chance":"99%"},{"id":"terramity:spectral_soul","n":"Spectral Soul","chance":"100%"},{"id":"terramity:ultra_sniffer_fur","n":"Ultra Sniffer Fur","chance":"44%"},{"id":"terramity:ultra_sniffers_pelt","n":"Ultra Sniffer's Pelt","chance":"44%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Energy beam","desc":"Fires a long beam that follows you."},{"name":"Uppercut and slam","desc":"Throws you very high and slams the ground."},{"name":"Warp strikes","desc":"In phase two warps around leaving traces that become strikes."},{"name":"Kamehameha","desc":"Below half health fires a faster, longer super beam."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"render","sources":["https://terramity.wiki.gg/wiki/Ultra_Sniffer"]},"Lord Pumpkinhead":{"entity":"born_in_chaos_v1:lord_pumpkinhead","mod":"Born in Chaos","find":"Use a Transmuting Elixir on an Infernal Evil Pumpkin.","drops":[{"id":"born_in_chaos_v1:soulbane","n":"Soulbane","chance":"100%"},{"id":"born_in_chaos_v1:pumpkinhandgun","n":"Pumpkin Pistol","chance":"100%"},{"id":"born_in_chaos_v1:magical_holiday_candy","n":"Magical Holiday Candy","chance":"100%"},{"id":"born_in_chaos_v1:pumpkin_bullet","n":"Pumpkin Bullet","chance":"100%"},{"id":"born_in_chaos_v1:bagof_candy","n":"Bag of Candy","chance":"100%"},{"id":"born_in_chaos_v1:smoldering_infernal_ember","n":"Smoldering Infernal Ember","chance":"100%"}],"attacks":[{"name":"Cursed strikes","desc":"Mounted hits that cause Soul Stratification and Infernal Flame; later Living Bomb."},{"name":"Teleport and bombs","desc":"Teleports, leaving Senior Pumpkins or pumpkin bombs behind."},{"name":"Pumpkin pistol","desc":"Dismounts and shoots; his horse fights up close."},{"name":"Headless","desc":"In the last stage his head shoots while his body fights."}],"img":"data:image/webp;base64,","img_src":"render","sources":["https://borninchaosmod.fandom.com/wiki/Lord_Pumpkinhead"]}};
